//@version=5
// Structure Break Signals — v9.0
// Facts-only market-structure reader. Every displayed value is derived from
// chart bars and the active settings; no score, probability, or trade advice.
//
// v9.0 key horizontal levels:
//   • Four ranked horizontal levels are calculated from confirmed pivots,
//     prior-session, completed opening-range, and completed overnight facts.
//   • Nearby sources are clustered; independent reference-family count is
//     displayed as agreement, never as a prediction of a reaction.
//   • Break candidates use the same frozen cluster prices drawn on the chart.
//   • Pivot-relationship terminology and exports have been removed.
//
// v8.4 measured level evidence:
//   • Active highs and lows are classified from completed first-approach
//     reactions versus matched ordinary chart bars, with 95% uncertainty.
//   • Labels are factual: stronger measured, weaker measured, no measured
//     separation, or evidence building. No arbitrary strength score is used.
//
// v8.3 guided usability:
//   • Market-neutral Fast, Standard, Broad, and Custom structure profiles.
//   • Compact, Standard, and Research dashboard detail levels.
//   • Plain-language state, missing-data, evidence-readiness, and glossary text.
//   • Candidate-only or all-transition advance-notice selection.
//
// v8.2 context + evidence:
//   • Fixed-horizon post-break evidence at 5/10/20 bars, paired with a rolling
//     non-break baseline matched by direction, session, and ATR regime.
//   • Active-structure width, location, age, nearest-boundary, and compression.
//   • Transition-only advance notices for approaches, candidates, cancellations,
//     confirmation countdowns, and broken-level return preparation.
//   • Session elapsed time, range location, opening range, prior-range relation,
//     and a separately calculated overnight range.
//
// v8.1 reliability pass:
//   • Break facts are frozen when the candidate first crosses its level, then
//     reported separately from facts measured on the confirmation bar.
//   • The session switch affects drawings and alerts only. Detection continues
//     across every loaded bar, and current/prior session O/H/L rolls correctly
//     on both extended-hours and regular-session-only charts.
//   • Return markers now refer to previously broken levels. Each tracked level
//     must move away, re-enter its ATR band, and close on the broken side.
//   • Pivot labels, break labels, lines, and tracked broken levels are bounded.
indicator("Structure Break Signals v9.0", overlay = true, max_bars_back = 5000, max_lines_count = 500, max_labels_count = 500)

// ───────────────────────────── Inputs ──────────────────────────────────────
grpQuick = "⓪ Quick setup"
structureProfile = input.string("Custom", "Structure profile", options = ["Custom", "Fast", "Standard", "Broad"], group = grpQuick,
     tooltip = "Custom preserves the numeric Structure settings below. Fast applies pivot 3, clearance 0.05 ATR, confirmation 0. Standard applies 5 / 0.10 / 1. Broad applies 10 / 0.10 / 1. Profiles change event definitions, not expected performance.")
dashboardDetail = input.string("Standard", "Dashboard detail", options = ["Compact", "Standard", "Research"], group = grpQuick,
     tooltip = "Compact shows the immediate structure facts. Standard adds event and historical context. Research restores the full facts panel and separate evidence table.")
showSessionContext = input.bool(false, "Show session context in dashboard", group = grpQuick,
     tooltip = "Market-neutral display control for the Standard dashboard. Research always includes the complete session facts. Calculations and Data Window exports continue regardless. Configure exchange-time sessions below before enabling it.")

grpCore = "① Structure"
swingLen = input.int(5, "Pivot confirmation bars", minval = 1, maxval = 50, group = grpCore,
     tooltip = "A pivot is confirmed only after this many later bars print. This is a known delay, not a prediction.")
atrLen = input.int(14, "ATR lookback", minval = 1, maxval = 200, group = grpCore)
minClearance = input.float(0.10, "Minimum initial close beyond level · ATR", minval = 0.0, step = 0.05, group = grpCore,
     tooltip = "Distance the first qualifying close must clear the active pivot level. Set 0 to accept every close through it.")
confirmBars = input.int(1, "Confirmation bars after initial cross", minval = 0, maxval = 20, group = grpCore,
     tooltip = "Additional bars the close must remain beyond the level before the event is confirmed. Candidate-bar and confirmation-bar measurements are retained separately.")

grpSession = "② Session facts"
sessionFilter = input.bool(false, "Display events only inside session", group = grpSession,
     tooltip = "OFF draws and alerts every confirmed event. ON hides drawings and alerts whose CONFIRMATION bar is outside the selected session. Detection, active-level updates, return tracking, and exports still use every loaded bar.")
selectedSession = input.session("0930-1600", "Selected session · exchange time", group = grpSession,
     tooltip = "Used for session O/H/L calculations and the optional display filter. TradingView interprets this in the symbol's exchange timezone.")
openingRangeMinutes = input.int(30, "Opening range minutes", minval = 1, maxval = 240, group = grpSession,
     tooltip = "The opening range uses completed chart bars whose opening time falls inside this many minutes from the selected-session start.")
overnightSession = input.session("1800-0930", "Overnight session · exchange time", group = grpSession,
     tooltip = "Separately tracks overnight O/H/L when those bars exist in the chart dataset. No value is invented on regular-session-only charts.")

grpDisplay = "③ Display"
showBreakLabels = input.bool(false, "Label confirmed breaks", group = grpDisplay)
showLiveLevels = input.bool(true, "Show key horizontal levels", group = grpDisplay)
showLevelTags = input.bool(true, "Show key-level labels", group = grpDisplay)
historyCount = input.int(0, "Confirmed break drawings to retain", minval = 0, maxval = 100, group = grpDisplay,
     tooltip = "Zero keeps the default chart to the live key-level map. Raise this to retain bounded historical break lines; detection and exported events are unchanged.")
lineWidth = input.int(1, "Level line width", minval = 1, maxval = 4, group = grpDisplay)
showTable = input.bool(true, "Chart facts table", group = grpDisplay,
     tooltip = "Shows the Compact, Standard, or Research dashboard selected in Quick setup.")
tablePosition = input.string("Top Right", "Table position", options = ["Top Right", "Top Left", "Bottom Right", "Bottom Left"], group = grpDisplay)

grpKeyLevels = "④ Key levels"
levelsPerSide = input.int(2, "Levels per side", minval = 1, maxval = 3, group = grpKeyLevels,
     tooltip = "Shows this many ranked clusters above and below. Ranking uses unique reference-family count, then distance, then newest constituent.")
keyClusterTolerance = input.float(0.20, "Cluster tolerance · ATR", minval = 0.01, maxval = 2.0, step = 0.05, group = grpKeyLevels,
     tooltip = "Confirmed sources within this current-ATR distance are combined. The line price is the equal-weight mean of the participating family prices.")
keyMaxDistance = input.float(10.0, "Maximum distance · ATR", minval = 0.5, maxval = 100.0, step = 0.5, group = grpKeyLevels)
keyMaxPivotAge = input.int(500, "Maximum pivot age · bars", minval = 20, maxval = 5000, group = grpKeyLevels)
keyMinFamilies = input.int(1, "Minimum reference families", minval = 1, maxval = 4, group = grpKeyLevels,
     tooltip = "One keeps standalone pivot clusters available. Higher values require agreement from more independent source families and can leave a side empty.")

grpReturns = "⑤ Broken-level returns"
showReturns = input.bool(true, "Mark broken-level returns", group = grpReturns)
returnBand = input.float(0.20, "Return tolerance · ATR", minval = 0.01, maxval = 2.0, step = 0.05, group = grpReturns,
     tooltip = "A return requires the candle to overlap this band around a previously broken level and close back on the broken side.")
returnMinAge = input.int(1, "Minimum bars after break", minval = 1, maxval = 100, group = grpReturns)
returnMaxAge = input.int(300, "Stop tracking after bars", minval = 10, maxval = 5000, group = grpReturns,
     tooltip = "Age limit for calculation-only broken-level records. Expiration is reported as a count and is not treated as an outcome.")
returnCooldown = input.int(5, "Minimum bars between repeated returns", minval = 1, maxval = 500, group = grpReturns)
maxTrackedBrokenLevels = input.int(200, "Maximum broken levels tracked", minval = 10, maxval = 500, group = grpReturns,
     tooltip = "Calculation safety bound. Capacity removals are counted explicitly and are never classified as successful or failed returns.")

grpEvidence = "⑥ Event evidence"
enableEvidence = input.bool(true, "Collect post-break evidence", group = grpEvidence,
     tooltip = "Measures what happened after each confirmed break. It reports historical observations and a non-break baseline; it does not score or predict the next event.")
evidenceShort = input.int(5, "Short horizon · bars", minval = 1, maxval = 50, group = grpEvidence)
evidenceMedium = input.int(10, "Medium horizon · bars", minval = 2, maxval = 75, group = grpEvidence)
evidenceLong = input.int(20, "Long horizon · bars", minval = 3, maxval = 100, group = grpEvidence)
evidenceThreshold = input.float(0.50, "First-hit threshold · ATR", minval = 0.05, maxval = 5.0, step = 0.05, group = grpEvidence,
     tooltip = "Records whether favorable or adverse excursion first reached this fixed multiple of the confirmation-bar ATR. If both occur in one candle, the result is marked ambiguous.")
evidenceCohort = input.string("Family count + session + ATR", "Evidence cohort", options = ["Side only", "Side + family count", "Family count + session", "Family count + session + ATR", "Full context"], group = grpEvidence,
     tooltip = "Controls which completed key-level break samples are included. Full context also matches initial-clearance, volume, and confirmation-delay buckets.")
minEvidenceSamples = input.int(20, "Minimum cohort samples", minval = 1, maxval = 500, group = grpEvidence,
     tooltip = "The table shows counts while building and only prints cohort statistics after this many completed break samples match.")
maxEvidenceSamples = input.int(500, "Maximum completed break samples", minval = 50, maxval = 2000, group = grpEvidence)
maxBaselineSamples = input.int(1500, "Maximum non-break baseline samples", minval = 100, maxval = 5000, group = grpEvidence,
     tooltip = "Baseline observations begin on completed non-break bars and use the same horizons. This bound is calculation history, not a success/failure classification.")
showEvidenceTable = input.bool(true, "Evidence table", group = grpEvidence,
     tooltip = "Shows the separate nine-row cohort table when Dashboard detail is Research. Compact and Standard summarize evidence in the main dashboard.")
evidenceTablePosition = input.string("Bottom Left", "Evidence table position", options = ["Top Right", "Top Left", "Bottom Right", "Bottom Left"], group = grpEvidence)

grpAdvance = "⑦ Advance notices"
enableAdvanceAlerts = input.bool(true, "Enable transition alerts", group = grpAdvance,
     tooltip = "Master switch for dynamic alert() messages selected below. Named confirmed-break and return conditions remain available. Create a TradingView alert using 'Any alert() function call' for dynamic notices.")
advanceNoticeDetail = input.string("All transitions", "Advance notice detail", options = ["Confirmed only", "Candidates", "All transitions"], group = grpAdvance,
     tooltip = "Confirmed only disables dynamic advance notices; named confirmed-break and return alert conditions remain available. Candidates adds candidate start, cancellation, and one-bar-remaining messages. All transitions also adds active-level approaches and broken-level preparation.")

grpLevelEvidence = "⑧ Key-level evidence"
enableLevelEvidence = input.bool(true, "Measure stronger / weaker evidence", group = grpLevelEvidence,
     tooltip = "Compares completed first-approach reactions at prior structural levels with ordinary starting bars from this chart. It reports measured separation, not a prediction or trade instruction.")
levelEvidenceHorizon = input.int(10, "Reaction window · bars", minval = 2, maxval = 50, group = grpLevelEvidence,
     tooltip = "Maximum completed bars allowed after a level's first approach for either reaction or close-through to occur.")
levelReactionThreshold = input.float(0.50, "Reaction distance · ATR", minval = 0.05, maxval = 5.0, step = 0.05, group = grpLevelEvidence,
     tooltip = "For a high, reaction means trading this distance below the level first. For a low, it means trading this distance above the level first. ATR is frozen on the approach bar.")
levelFailureThreshold = input.float(0.10, "Close-through distance · ATR", minval = 0.0, maxval = 2.0, step = 0.05, group = grpLevelEvidence,
     tooltip = "A high fails the reaction race when a completed close first exceeds the level by this distance. A low uses the mirrored close below. Same-bar reaction and close-through is recorded as ambiguous.")
minLevelEvidenceSamples = input.int(20, "Minimum level samples", minval = 5, maxval = 500, group = grpLevelEvidence,
     tooltip = "Stronger or weaker is printed only when both the structural-level cohort and ordinary-bar baseline reach this sample count and their 95% difference interval excludes zero.")
maxLevelEvidenceSamples = input.int(1000, "Maximum level samples", minval = 100, maxval = 3000, group = grpLevelEvidence,
     tooltip = "Calculation-history bound for completed structural-level observations. The ordinary-bar baseline retains up to three times this number.")

// ───────────────────────────── Helpers ─────────────────────────────────────
pushBoundedLabel(array<label> ids, label id, int keep) =>
    array.push(ids, id)
    while array.size(ids) > keep
        label.delete(array.shift(ids))

atrBucket(float percentile) =>
    na(percentile) ? -1 : percentile < 33 ? 0 : percentile < 67 ? 1 : 2

clearanceBucket(float value) =>
    na(value) ? -1 : value < 0.25 ? 0 : value < 0.50 ? 1 : 2

volumeBucket(float value) =>
    na(value) ? -1 : value < 0.80 ? 0 : value <= 1.20 ? 1 : 2

delayBucket(int value) =>
    na(value) ? -1 : value == 0 ? 0 : value == 1 ? 1 : 2

tablePositionOf(string value) =>
    value == "Top Left" ? position.top_left : value == "Bottom Right" ? position.bottom_right : value == "Bottom Left" ? position.bottom_left : position.top_right

int effectiveSwingLen = structureProfile == "Fast" ? 3 : structureProfile == "Standard" ? 5 : structureProfile == "Broad" ? 10 : swingLen
float effectiveMinClearance = structureProfile == "Fast" ? 0.05 : structureProfile == "Standard" or structureProfile == "Broad" ? 0.10 : minClearance
int effectiveConfirmBars = structureProfile == "Fast" ? 0 : structureProfile == "Standard" or structureProfile == "Broad" ? 1 : confirmBars

type ActiveEvidence
    int startBar
    int direction
    int familyCount
    bool inSession
    int atrRegime
    int clearanceRegime
    int volumeRegime
    int delayRegime
    float anchor
    float level
    float baseAtr
    float maxFavorable
    float maxAdverse
    float mfeShort
    float maeShort
    float finalShort
    int firstShort
    float mfeMedium
    float maeMedium
    float finalMedium
    int firstMedium
    int firstOutcome
    bool returnArmed
    bool returnInBand
    int returnAge
    bool crossedBack

type EvidenceResult
    int direction
    int familyCount
    bool inSession
    int atrRegime
    int clearanceRegime
    int volumeRegime
    int delayRegime
    float mfeShort
    float maeShort
    float finalShort
    int firstShort
    float mfeMedium
    float maeMedium
    float finalMedium
    int firstMedium
    float mfeLong
    float maeLong
    float finalLong
    int firstLong
    int returnAge
    bool crossedBack

type BaselineResult
    bool inSession
    int atrRegime
    float upMfeShort
    float upMaeShort
    float upMfeMedium
    float upMaeMedium
    float upMfeLong
    float upMaeLong

type ActiveLevelReaction
    int startBar
    int direction
    int contextCount
    bool inSession
    int atrRegime
    float level
    float baseAtr

type LevelReactionResult
    int direction
    int contextCount
    bool inSession
    int atrRegime
    int outcome

type LevelBaselineResult
    int direction
    bool inSession
    int atrRegime
    int outcome

type LevelSource
    int id
    int family
    int side
    int createdBar
    float price
    bool consumed

replaceLevelSource(array<LevelSource> sources, int family, int side, float price, int createdBar, int nextId) =>
    if array.size(sources) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(sources) - 1
            LevelSource old = array.get(sources, i)
            if old.family == family and old.side == side and not old.consumed
                old.consumed := true
                array.set(sources, i, old)
    LevelSource fresh = LevelSource.new()
    fresh.id := nextId
    fresh.family := family
    fresh.side := side
    fresh.createdBar := createdBar
    fresh.price := price
    fresh.consumed := false
    array.push(sources, fresh)
    nextId + 1

appendLevelSource(array<LevelSource> sources, int family, int side, float price, int createdBar, int nextId) =>
    LevelSource fresh = LevelSource.new()
    fresh.id := nextId
    fresh.family := family
    fresh.side := side
    fresh.createdBar := createdBar
    fresh.price := price
    fresh.consumed := false
    array.push(sources, fresh)
    nextId + 1

familyMaskText(int mask, int pivotObservations) =>
    string txt = ""
    if mask % 2 == 1
        txt := "pivot" + (pivotObservations > 1 ? " (" + str.tostring(pivotObservations) + " observations)" : "")
    if math.floor(mask / 2) % 2 == 1
        txt := txt == "" ? "prior session" : txt + " + prior session"
    if math.floor(mask / 4) % 2 == 1
        txt := txt == "" ? "opening range" : txt + " + opening range"
    if math.floor(mask / 8) % 2 == 1
        txt := txt == "" ? "overnight" : txt + " + overnight"
    txt == "" ? "none" : txt

keyLevelTooltip(float price, int familyCount, int mask, int pivotObservations, int newestBar, int oldestBar, float currentAtr, float tolerance, string evidenceText) =>
    string distanceText = currentAtr > 0 ? str.tostring(math.abs(price - close) / currentAtr, "#.##") + " ATR" : "unavailable"
    "Calculated cluster mean: " + str.tostring(price, format.mintick) + "\nIndependent reference families: " + str.tostring(familyCount) + "\nSources: " + familyMaskText(mask, pivotObservations) + "\nCluster tolerance: " + str.tostring(tolerance, "#.##") + " ATR\nDistance from close: " + distanceText + "\nNewest / oldest source age: " + str.tostring(bar_index - newestBar) + " / " + str.tostring(bar_index - oldestBar) + " bars\nHistorical reaction evidence: " + evidenceText + "\nReference agreement is factual and is not a prediction that price will react."

levelEvidenceSummary(array<LevelReactionResult> observations, array<LevelBaselineResult> baselines, int direction, int contextCount, bool birthSession, int birthAtrRegime, int minimumSamples) =>
    int exactN = 0
    int contextN = 0
    int directionN = 0
    if array.size(observations) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(observations) - 1
            LevelReactionResult r = array.get(observations, i)
            if r.direction == direction
                directionN += 1
                if r.contextCount == contextCount
                    contextN += 1
                    if r.inSession == birthSession and r.atrRegime == birthAtrRegime
                        exactN += 1
    int cohortMode = exactN >= minimumSamples ? 2 : contextN >= minimumSamples ? 1 : 0
    int levelN = 0
    int levelReactions = 0
    if array.size(observations) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(observations) - 1
            LevelReactionResult r = array.get(observations, i)
            bool match = r.direction == direction
            if cohortMode >= 1
                match := match and r.contextCount == contextCount
            if cohortMode == 2
                match := match and r.inSession == birthSession and r.atrRegime == birthAtrRegime
            if match
                levelN += 1
                if r.outcome == 1
                    levelReactions += 1
    int baselineN = 0
    int baselineReactions = 0
    if array.size(baselines) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(baselines) - 1
            LevelBaselineResult b = array.get(baselines, i)
            bool match = b.direction == direction
            if cohortMode == 2
                match := match and b.inSession == birthSession and b.atrRegime == birthAtrRegime
            if match
                baselineN += 1
                if b.outcome == 1
                    baselineReactions += 1
    float levelRate = levelN > 0 ? levelReactions / levelN : na
    float baselineRate = baselineN > 0 ? baselineReactions / baselineN : na
    float difference = not na(levelRate) and not na(baselineRate) ? levelRate - baselineRate : na
    float standardError = levelN > 0 and baselineN > 0 ? math.sqrt(levelRate * (1.0 - levelRate) / levelN + baselineRate * (1.0 - baselineRate) / baselineN) : na
    float lower = not na(standardError) ? difference - 1.96 * standardError : na
    float upper = not na(standardError) ? difference + 1.96 * standardError : na
    bool ready = levelN >= minimumSamples and baselineN >= minimumSamples
    int status = not ready ? 0 : lower > 0 ? 2 : upper < 0 ? -2 : 1
    [status, levelN, baselineN, levelRate, baselineRate, lower, upper, cohortMode]

levelStatusName(int status) =>
    status == 2 ? "Stronger measured" : status == -2 ? "Weaker measured" : status == 1 ? "No measured separation" : status == 0 ? "Evidence building" : "No active level"

levelCohortName(int mode) =>
    mode == 2 ? "context + session + ATR" : mode == 1 ? "context count" : "level side"

// ───────────────────────────── Base calculations ──────────────────────────
float atr = ta.atr(atrLen)
float atrPct = ta.percentrank(atr, 100)
float volAvg = ta.sma(volume, 20)
float volumeMultiple = not na(volAvg) and volAvg > 0 ? volume / volAvg : na

if barstate.isfirst and not (evidenceShort < evidenceMedium and evidenceMedium < evidenceLong)
    runtime.error("Event evidence horizons must satisfy Short < Medium < Long.")

// ───────────────────────────── Session facts ──────────────────────────────
bool insideSession = not na(time(timeframe.period, selectedSession))
bool priorInside = bar_index > 0 ? insideSession[1] : false
// `not priorInside` alone cannot find a new session on regular-session-only
// charts: the last bar yesterday and first bar today are both inside. The
// trading-day transition supplies the missing boundary without requiring an
// overnight bar to exist.
bool newTradingDay = bar_index > 0 and ta.change(time_tradingday) != 0
bool sessionStart = insideSession and (not priorInside or newTradingDay)
bool sessionEnd = not insideSession and priorInside
bool eventVisibleNow = not sessionFilter or insideSession

var float sessionOpen = na
var float sessionHigh = na
var float sessionLow = na
var float priorSessionOpen = na
var float priorSessionHigh = na
var float priorSessionLow = na
var int sessionStartTime = na
var float openingRangeHigh = na
var float openingRangeLow = na
var bool openingRangeComplete = false

// Copy at the next start as well as at the end. The start-side copy is what
// makes prior-session facts work on charts that contain no outside-session bar.
if sessionStart
    if not na(sessionOpen)
        priorSessionOpen := sessionOpen
        priorSessionHigh := sessionHigh
        priorSessionLow := sessionLow
    sessionOpen := open
    sessionHigh := high
    sessionLow := low
    sessionStartTime := time
    openingRangeHigh := high
    openingRangeLow := low
    openingRangeComplete := false
else if insideSession
    sessionHigh := na(sessionHigh) ? high : math.max(sessionHigh, high)
    sessionLow := na(sessionLow) ? low : math.min(sessionLow, low)
    if not na(sessionStartTime) and time < sessionStartTime + openingRangeMinutes * 60000
        openingRangeHigh := na(openingRangeHigh) ? high : math.max(openingRangeHigh, high)
        openingRangeLow := na(openingRangeLow) ? low : math.min(openingRangeLow, low)
    else if not na(sessionStartTime)
        openingRangeComplete := true

if sessionEnd
    priorSessionOpen := sessionOpen
    priorSessionHigh := sessionHigh
    priorSessionLow := sessionLow
    sessionOpen := na
    sessionHigh := na
    sessionLow := na
    openingRangeComplete := not na(openingRangeHigh)

float sessionElapsedMinutes = insideSession and not na(sessionStartTime) ? math.max(0.0, (time_close - sessionStartTime) / 60000.0) : na
float sessionRangeAtr = insideSession and atr > 0 and not na(sessionHigh) and not na(sessionLow) ? (sessionHigh - sessionLow) / atr : na
float sessionRangePosition = insideSession and not na(sessionHigh) and not na(sessionLow) and sessionHigh > sessionLow ? 100.0 * (close - sessionLow) / (sessionHigh - sessionLow) : na
float currentSessionHighDistance = insideSession and atr > 0 and not na(sessionHigh) ? (sessionHigh - close) / atr : na
float currentSessionLowDistance = insideSession and atr > 0 and not na(sessionLow) ? (close - sessionLow) / atr : na
int priorRangeRelation = na(priorSessionHigh) or na(priorSessionLow) ? 0 : close > priorSessionHigh ? 1 : close < priorSessionLow ? -1 : 2
float priorHighDistance = atr > 0 and not na(priorSessionHigh) ? (priorSessionHigh - close) / atr : na
float priorLowDistance = atr > 0 and not na(priorSessionLow) ? (close - priorSessionLow) / atr : na

// Overnight facts are calculated only from overnight bars present in the
// loaded dataset. On a regular-session-only chart these fields remain na.
bool insideOvernight = not na(time(timeframe.period, overnightSession))
bool priorInsideOvernight = bar_index > 0 ? insideOvernight[1] : false
bool overnightStart = insideOvernight and not priorInsideOvernight
bool overnightEnd = not insideOvernight and priorInsideOvernight
var float overnightOpen = na
var float overnightHigh = na
var float overnightLow = na
var float lastOvernightOpen = na
var float lastOvernightHigh = na
var float lastOvernightLow = na

if overnightStart
    overnightOpen := open
    overnightHigh := high
    overnightLow := low
else if insideOvernight
    overnightHigh := na(overnightHigh) ? high : math.max(overnightHigh, high)
    overnightLow := na(overnightLow) ? low : math.min(overnightLow, low)

if overnightEnd
    lastOvernightOpen := overnightOpen
    lastOvernightHigh := overnightHigh
    lastOvernightLow := overnightLow
    overnightOpen := na
    overnightHigh := na
    overnightLow := na

float referenceOvernightHigh = insideOvernight ? overnightHigh : lastOvernightHigh
float referenceOvernightLow = insideOvernight ? overnightLow : lastOvernightLow
int overnightRangeRelation = na(referenceOvernightHigh) or na(referenceOvernightLow) ? 0 : close > referenceOvernightHigh ? 1 : close < referenceOvernightLow ? -1 : 2

// ───────────────────────────── Key-level sources and clusters ──────────────
// Families: 1 pivot, 2 prior session, 3 opening range, 4 overnight.
// Sides: 1 upper-source family, -1 lower-source family. These describe the
// source calculation and do not claim resistance/support behavior.
float pivotHigh = ta.pivothigh(high, effectiveSwingLen, effectiveSwingLen)
float pivotLow = ta.pivotlow(low, effectiveSwingLen, effectiveSwingLen)
int pivotBar = bar_index - effectiveSwingLen
bool confirmedPivotHighEvent = barstate.isconfirmed and not na(pivotHigh)
bool confirmedPivotLowEvent = barstate.isconfirmed and not na(pivotLow)

var array<LevelSource> levelSources = array.new<LevelSource>(0)
var int nextLevelSourceId = 1
if confirmedPivotHighEvent
    nextLevelSourceId := appendLevelSource(levelSources, 1, 1, pivotHigh, pivotBar, nextLevelSourceId)
if confirmedPivotLowEvent
    nextLevelSourceId := appendLevelSource(levelSources, 1, -1, pivotLow, pivotBar, nextLevelSourceId)

bool priorReferenceCompleted = sessionEnd or (sessionStart and newTradingDay and priorInside)
if priorReferenceCompleted and not na(priorSessionHigh) and not na(priorSessionLow)
    nextLevelSourceId := replaceLevelSource(levelSources, 2, 1, priorSessionHigh, bar_index, nextLevelSourceId)
    nextLevelSourceId := replaceLevelSource(levelSources, 2, -1, priorSessionLow, bar_index, nextLevelSourceId)

bool openingRangeJustCompleted = openingRangeComplete and (bar_index == 0 or not openingRangeComplete[1])
if openingRangeJustCompleted and not na(openingRangeHigh) and not na(openingRangeLow)
    nextLevelSourceId := replaceLevelSource(levelSources, 3, 1, openingRangeHigh, bar_index, nextLevelSourceId)
    nextLevelSourceId := replaceLevelSource(levelSources, 3, -1, openingRangeLow, bar_index, nextLevelSourceId)

if overnightEnd and not na(lastOvernightHigh) and not na(lastOvernightLow)
    nextLevelSourceId := replaceLevelSource(levelSources, 4, 1, lastOvernightHigh, bar_index, nextLevelSourceId)
    nextLevelSourceId := replaceLevelSource(levelSources, 4, -1, lastOvernightLow, bar_index, nextLevelSourceId)

// Remove consumed records and aged pivot records. Session records are replaced
// by their next completed period and therefore have no arbitrary bar expiry.
if array.size(levelSources) > 0
    for i = array.size(levelSources) - 1 to 0
        LevelSource source = array.get(levelSources, i)
        if source.consumed or (source.family == 1 and bar_index - source.createdBar > keyMaxPivotAge)
            array.remove(levelSources, i)
while array.size(levelSources) > 200
    array.shift(levelSources)

// Sort source indices by price so grouping is deterministic.
var array<int> sourceOrder = array.new_int(0)
array.clear(sourceOrder)
if array.size(levelSources) > 0
    for i = 0 to array.size(levelSources) - 1
        array.push(sourceOrder, i)
        if array.size(sourceOrder) > 1
            for j = array.size(sourceOrder) - 1 to 1
                int rightIndex = array.get(sourceOrder, j)
                int leftIndex = array.get(sourceOrder, j - 1)
                if array.get(levelSources, rightIndex).price < array.get(levelSources, leftIndex).price
                    array.set(sourceOrder, j, leftIndex)
                    array.set(sourceOrder, j - 1, rightIndex)
                else
                    break

var array<int> clusterSides = array.new_int(0)
var array<float> clusterSeedSums = array.new_float(0)
var array<int> clusterSeedCounts = array.new_int(0)
var array<int> memberClusters = array.new_int(0)
var array<int> memberSources = array.new_int(0)
array.clear(clusterSides)
array.clear(clusterSeedSums)
array.clear(clusterSeedCounts)
array.clear(memberClusters)
array.clear(memberSources)
float clusterBand = atr * keyClusterTolerance

if atr > 0 and array.size(sourceOrder) > 0
    for orderPos = 0 to array.size(sourceOrder) - 1
        int sourceIndex = array.get(sourceOrder, orderPos)
        LevelSource source = array.get(levelSources, sourceIndex)
        int matchedCluster = -1
        if array.size(clusterSides) > 0
            for c = 0 to array.size(clusterSides) - 1
                float seedMean = array.get(clusterSeedSums, c) / array.get(clusterSeedCounts, c)
                if array.get(clusterSides, c) == source.side and math.abs(source.price - seedMean) <= clusterBand
                    matchedCluster := c
                    break
        if matchedCluster == -1
            matchedCluster := array.size(clusterSides)
            array.push(clusterSides, source.side)
            array.push(clusterSeedSums, source.price)
            array.push(clusterSeedCounts, 1)
        else
            array.set(clusterSeedSums, matchedCluster, array.get(clusterSeedSums, matchedCluster) + source.price)
            array.set(clusterSeedCounts, matchedCluster, array.get(clusterSeedCounts, matchedCluster) + 1)
        array.push(memberClusters, matchedCluster)
        array.push(memberSources, sourceIndex)

var array<float> clusterPrices = array.new_float(0)
var array<int> clusterFamilyCounts = array.new_int(0)
var array<int> clusterMasks = array.new_int(0)
var array<int> clusterPivotObservations = array.new_int(0)
var array<int> clusterNewestBars = array.new_int(0)
var array<int> clusterOldestBars = array.new_int(0)
var array<string> clusterFingerprints = array.new_string(0)
array.clear(clusterPrices)
array.clear(clusterFamilyCounts)
array.clear(clusterMasks)
array.clear(clusterPivotObservations)
array.clear(clusterNewestBars)
array.clear(clusterOldestBars)
array.clear(clusterFingerprints)

if array.size(clusterSides) > 0
    for c = 0 to array.size(clusterSides) - 1
        float pivotSum = 0.0
        float priorSum = 0.0
        float openingSum = 0.0
        float overnightSum = 0.0
        int pivotCount = 0
        int priorCount = 0
        int openingCount = 0
        int overnightCount = 0
        int newestBar = -1
        int oldestBar = bar_index
        string fingerprint = ""
        if array.size(memberClusters) > 0
            for m = 0 to array.size(memberClusters) - 1
                if array.get(memberClusters, m) == c
                    LevelSource source = array.get(levelSources, array.get(memberSources, m))
                    if source.family == 1
                        pivotSum += source.price
                        pivotCount += 1
                    else if source.family == 2
                        priorSum += source.price
                        priorCount += 1
                    else if source.family == 3
                        openingSum += source.price
                        openingCount += 1
                    else
                        overnightSum += source.price
                        overnightCount += 1
                    newestBar := math.max(newestBar, source.createdBar)
                    oldestBar := math.min(oldestBar, source.createdBar)
                    fingerprint += "|" + str.tostring(source.id) + "|"
        int familyCount = (pivotCount > 0 ? 1 : 0) + (priorCount > 0 ? 1 : 0) + (openingCount > 0 ? 1 : 0) + (overnightCount > 0 ? 1 : 0)
        int mask = (pivotCount > 0 ? 1 : 0) + (priorCount > 0 ? 2 : 0) + (openingCount > 0 ? 4 : 0) + (overnightCount > 0 ? 8 : 0)
        float familyPriceSum = (pivotCount > 0 ? pivotSum / pivotCount : 0.0) + (priorCount > 0 ? priorSum / priorCount : 0.0) + (openingCount > 0 ? openingSum / openingCount : 0.0) + (overnightCount > 0 ? overnightSum / overnightCount : 0.0)
        array.push(clusterPrices, familyCount > 0 ? familyPriceSum / familyCount : na)
        array.push(clusterFamilyCounts, familyCount)
        array.push(clusterMasks, mask)
        array.push(clusterPivotObservations, pivotCount)
        array.push(clusterNewestBars, newestBar)
        array.push(clusterOldestBars, oldestBar)
        array.push(clusterFingerprints, fingerprint)

// Select by agreement, distance, then newest; order the selected subset by
// distance so Above/Below 1 is always the monitored boundary.
var array<int> selectedUpper = array.new_int(0)
var array<int> selectedLower = array.new_int(0)
array.clear(selectedUpper)
array.clear(selectedLower)
if atr > 0 and array.size(clusterPrices) > 0
    for rank = 0 to levelsPerSide - 1
        int bestUpper = -1
        int bestLower = -1
        for c = 0 to array.size(clusterPrices) - 1
            float clusterPrice = array.get(clusterPrices, c)
            float distance = math.abs(clusterPrice - close) / atr
            bool eligible = array.get(clusterFamilyCounts, c) >= keyMinFamilies and distance <= keyMaxDistance
            // A just-crossed boundary remains eligible on its crossing bar so
            // the candidate can freeze it. Older crossed references are
            // retired below and disappear on the next rebuild.
            bool upperPosition = clusterPrice >= close or (bar_index > 0 and close[1] <= clusterPrice)
            bool lowerPosition = clusterPrice <= close or (bar_index > 0 and close[1] >= clusterPrice)
            if eligible and upperPosition and array.get(clusterSides, c) == 1 and not array.includes(selectedUpper, c)
                bool better = bestUpper == -1
                if bestUpper != -1
                    int candidateFamilies = array.get(clusterFamilyCounts, c)
                    int incumbentFamilies = array.get(clusterFamilyCounts, bestUpper)
                    float incumbentDistance = math.abs(array.get(clusterPrices, bestUpper) - close) / atr
                    better := candidateFamilies > incumbentFamilies or (candidateFamilies == incumbentFamilies and (distance < incumbentDistance or (distance == incumbentDistance and array.get(clusterNewestBars, c) > array.get(clusterNewestBars, bestUpper))))
                if better
                    bestUpper := c
            if eligible and lowerPosition and array.get(clusterSides, c) == -1 and not array.includes(selectedLower, c)
                bool better = bestLower == -1
                if bestLower != -1
                    int candidateFamilies = array.get(clusterFamilyCounts, c)
                    int incumbentFamilies = array.get(clusterFamilyCounts, bestLower)
                    float incumbentDistance = math.abs(array.get(clusterPrices, bestLower) - close) / atr
                    better := candidateFamilies > incumbentFamilies or (candidateFamilies == incumbentFamilies and (distance < incumbentDistance or (distance == incumbentDistance and array.get(clusterNewestBars, c) > array.get(clusterNewestBars, bestLower))))
                if better
                    bestLower := c
        if bestUpper != -1
            array.push(selectedUpper, bestUpper)
        if bestLower != -1
            array.push(selectedLower, bestLower)

if array.size(selectedUpper) > 1
    for i = 0 to array.size(selectedUpper) - 2
        for j = i + 1 to array.size(selectedUpper) - 1
            int a = array.get(selectedUpper, i)
            int b = array.get(selectedUpper, j)
            if math.abs(array.get(clusterPrices, b) - close) < math.abs(array.get(clusterPrices, a) - close)
                array.set(selectedUpper, i, b)
                array.set(selectedUpper, j, a)
if array.size(selectedLower) > 1
    for i = 0 to array.size(selectedLower) - 2
        for j = i + 1 to array.size(selectedLower) - 1
            int a = array.get(selectedLower, i)
            int b = array.get(selectedLower, j)
            if math.abs(array.get(clusterPrices, b) - close) < math.abs(array.get(clusterPrices, a) - close)
                array.set(selectedLower, i, b)
                array.set(selectedLower, j, a)

int upper1Index = -1
int upper2Index = -1
int upper3Index = -1
int lower1Index = -1
int lower2Index = -1
int lower3Index = -1
if array.size(selectedUpper) > 0
    upper1Index := array.get(selectedUpper, 0)
if array.size(selectedUpper) > 1
    upper2Index := array.get(selectedUpper, 1)
if array.size(selectedUpper) > 2
    upper3Index := array.get(selectedUpper, 2)
if array.size(selectedLower) > 0
    lower1Index := array.get(selectedLower, 0)
if array.size(selectedLower) > 1
    lower2Index := array.get(selectedLower, 1)
if array.size(selectedLower) > 2
    lower3Index := array.get(selectedLower, 2)

float activeHigh = na
float activeLow = na
float keyAbove2 = na
float keyAbove3 = na
float keyBelow2 = na
float keyBelow3 = na
int activeHighBar = na
int activeLowBar = na
int activeHighContextCount = 0
int activeLowContextCount = 0
string activeHighContextTags = "none"
string activeLowContextTags = "none"
string activeHighFingerprint = ""
string activeLowFingerprint = ""
if upper1Index >= 0
    activeHigh := array.get(clusterPrices, upper1Index)
    activeHighBar := array.get(clusterNewestBars, upper1Index)
    activeHighContextCount := array.get(clusterFamilyCounts, upper1Index)
    activeHighContextTags := familyMaskText(array.get(clusterMasks, upper1Index), array.get(clusterPivotObservations, upper1Index))
    activeHighFingerprint := array.get(clusterFingerprints, upper1Index)
if lower1Index >= 0
    activeLow := array.get(clusterPrices, lower1Index)
    activeLowBar := array.get(clusterNewestBars, lower1Index)
    activeLowContextCount := array.get(clusterFamilyCounts, lower1Index)
    activeLowContextTags := familyMaskText(array.get(clusterMasks, lower1Index), array.get(clusterPivotObservations, lower1Index))
    activeLowFingerprint := array.get(clusterFingerprints, lower1Index)
if upper2Index >= 0
    keyAbove2 := array.get(clusterPrices, upper2Index)
if upper3Index >= 0
    keyAbove3 := array.get(clusterPrices, upper3Index)
if lower2Index >= 0
    keyBelow2 := array.get(clusterPrices, lower2Index)
if lower3Index >= 0
    keyBelow3 := array.get(clusterPrices, lower3Index)
var string priorActiveHighFingerprint = ""
var string priorActiveLowFingerprint = ""
var int highApproaches = 0
var int lowApproaches = 0
var bool highInBand = false
var bool lowInBand = false
var bool activeHighBirthSession = false
var bool activeLowBirthSession = false
var int activeHighBirthAtrRegime = -1
var int activeLowBirthAtrRegime = -1
var bool activeHighEvidenceStarted = false
var bool activeLowEvidenceStarted = false

bool upperClusterChanged = activeHighFingerprint != priorActiveHighFingerprint
bool lowerClusterChanged = activeLowFingerprint != priorActiveLowFingerprint
if upperClusterChanged
    highApproaches := 0
    highInBand := false
    activeHighBirthSession := insideSession
    activeHighBirthAtrRegime := atrBucket(atrPct)
    activeHighEvidenceStarted := false
    priorActiveHighFingerprint := activeHighFingerprint
if lowerClusterChanged
    lowApproaches := 0
    lowInBand := false
    activeLowBirthSession := insideSession
    activeLowBirthAtrRegime := atrBucket(atrPct)
    activeLowEvidenceStarted := false
    priorActiveLowFingerprint := activeLowFingerprint

var float priorStructureSnapshot = na
var float latestStructureSnapshot = na
var string priorStructurePair = ""
string currentStructurePair = activeHighFingerprint + "/" + activeLowFingerprint
if currentStructurePair != priorStructurePair and not na(activeHigh) and not na(activeLow)
    priorStructureSnapshot := latestStructureSnapshot
    latestStructureSnapshot := math.abs(activeHigh - activeLow)
    priorStructurePair := currentStructurePair

int structureChange = na(priorStructureSnapshot) or na(latestStructureSnapshot) ? 0 : latestStructureSnapshot < priorStructureSnapshot ? -1 : latestStructureSnapshot > priorStructureSnapshot ? 1 : 2

// An approach is one transition into the current ATR band around an unbroken
// active level. It is deliberately not called a test or hold.
float approachBand = atr * returnBand
bool evtApproachHigh = false
bool evtApproachLow = false
float approachedActiveHighLevel = na
float approachedActiveLowLevel = na
int approachedHighContextCount = na
int approachedLowContextCount = na
bool approachedHighBirthSession = false
bool approachedLowBirthSession = false
int approachedHighBirthAtrRegime = -1
int approachedLowBirthAtrRegime = -1
if not na(activeHigh) and atr > 0
    bool touchingHigh = high >= activeHigh - approachBand and low <= activeHigh + approachBand
    if barstate.isconfirmed
        if touchingHigh and not highInBand
            highApproaches += 1
            evtApproachHigh := true
            approachedActiveHighLevel := activeHigh
            approachedHighContextCount := activeHighContextCount
            approachedHighBirthSession := activeHighBirthSession
            approachedHighBirthAtrRegime := activeHighBirthAtrRegime
        highInBand := touchingHigh
if not na(activeLow) and atr > 0
    bool touchingLow = high >= activeLow - approachBand and low <= activeLow + approachBand
    if barstate.isconfirmed
        if touchingLow and not lowInBand
            lowApproaches += 1
            evtApproachLow := true
            approachedActiveLowLevel := activeLow
            approachedLowContextCount := activeLowContextCount
            approachedLowBirthSession := activeLowBirthSession
            approachedLowBirthAtrRegime := activeLowBirthAtrRegime
        lowInBand := touchingLow

float highDistance = not na(activeHigh) and atr > 0 ? (activeHigh - close) / atr : na
float lowDistance = not na(activeLow) and atr > 0 ? (close - activeLow) / atr : na
float structureTop = not na(activeHigh) and not na(activeLow) ? math.max(activeHigh, activeLow) : na
float structureBottom = not na(activeHigh) and not na(activeLow) ? math.min(activeHigh, activeLow) : na
float structureWidth = not na(structureTop) ? structureTop - structureBottom : na
float structureWidthAtr = not na(structureWidth) and atr > 0 ? structureWidth / atr : na
float structurePosition = not na(structureWidth) and structureWidth > 0 ? 100.0 * (close - structureBottom) / structureWidth : na
int activeHighAge = na(activeHighBar) ? na : bar_index - activeHighBar
int activeLowAge = na(activeLowBar) ? na : bar_index - activeLowBar
int nearestBoundary = na(highDistance) ? (na(lowDistance) ? 0 : -1) : na(lowDistance) ? 1 : math.abs(highDistance) <= math.abs(lowDistance) ? 1 : -1

// ───────────────────────────── Break candidates ───────────────────────────
// Up and down candidates are independent so one side cannot block the other.
var int pendingUpBar = na
var float pendingUpLevel = na
var int pendingUpLevelBar = na
var int pendingUpOldestBar = na
var int pendingUpFamilyCount = 0
var int pendingUpMask = 0
var int pendingUpPivotObservations = 0
var string pendingUpFingerprint = ""
var array<int> pendingUpSourceIds = array.new_int(0)
var float pendingUpClearance = na
var float pendingUpRangeAtr = na
var float pendingUpBodyRatio = na
var float pendingUpVolumeMultiple = na
var float pendingUpAtr = na
var float pendingUpClose = na
var bool pendingUpInsideSession = false

var int pendingDownBar = na
var float pendingDownLevel = na
var int pendingDownLevelBar = na
var int pendingDownOldestBar = na
var int pendingDownFamilyCount = 0
var int pendingDownMask = 0
var int pendingDownPivotObservations = 0
var string pendingDownFingerprint = ""
var array<int> pendingDownSourceIds = array.new_int(0)
var float pendingDownClearance = na
var float pendingDownRangeAtr = na
var float pendingDownBodyRatio = na
var float pendingDownVolumeMultiple = na
var float pendingDownAtr = na
var float pendingDownClose = na
var bool pendingDownInsideSession = false

bool evtCandidateUpStarted = false
bool evtCandidateDownStarted = false
bool evtCandidateUpCanceled = false
bool evtCandidateDownCanceled = false
bool evtUpOneRemaining = false
bool evtDownOneRemaining = false

if barstate.isconfirmed and not na(pendingUpBar) and close <= pendingUpLevel
    evtCandidateUpCanceled := true
    pendingUpBar := na
    array.clear(pendingUpSourceIds)
if barstate.isconfirmed and not na(pendingDownBar) and close >= pendingDownLevel
    evtCandidateDownCanceled := true
    pendingDownBar := na
    array.clear(pendingDownSourceIds)

float monitoredHigh = not na(pendingUpBar) ? pendingUpLevel : activeHigh
float monitoredLow = not na(pendingDownBar) ? pendingDownLevel : activeLow
bool rawUp = barstate.isconfirmed and not na(monitoredHigh) and atr > 0 and close > monitoredHigh + atr * effectiveMinClearance
bool rawDown = barstate.isconfirmed and not na(monitoredLow) and atr > 0 and close < monitoredLow - atr * effectiveMinClearance

// Freeze initial-cross measurements. Later bars cannot rewrite these facts.
if na(pendingUpBar) and rawUp
    evtCandidateUpStarted := true
    pendingUpBar := bar_index
    pendingUpLevel := monitoredHigh
    pendingUpLevelBar := activeHighBar
    pendingUpOldestBar := activeHighBar
    pendingUpFamilyCount := activeHighContextCount
    pendingUpMask := 0
    pendingUpPivotObservations := 0
    if upper1Index >= 0
        pendingUpOldestBar := array.get(clusterOldestBars, upper1Index)
        pendingUpMask := array.get(clusterMasks, upper1Index)
        pendingUpPivotObservations := array.get(clusterPivotObservations, upper1Index)
    pendingUpFingerprint := activeHighFingerprint
    array.clear(pendingUpSourceIds)
    if upper1Index >= 0 and array.size(memberClusters) > 0
        for m = 0 to array.size(memberClusters) - 1
            if array.get(memberClusters, m) == upper1Index
                array.push(pendingUpSourceIds, array.get(levelSources, array.get(memberSources, m)).id)
    pendingUpClearance := (close - monitoredHigh) / atr
    pendingUpRangeAtr := (high - low) / atr
    pendingUpBodyRatio := high != low ? math.abs(close - open) / (high - low) : na
    pendingUpVolumeMultiple := volumeMultiple
    pendingUpAtr := atr
    pendingUpClose := close
    pendingUpInsideSession := insideSession

if na(pendingDownBar) and rawDown
    evtCandidateDownStarted := true
    pendingDownBar := bar_index
    pendingDownLevel := monitoredLow
    pendingDownLevelBar := activeLowBar
    pendingDownOldestBar := activeLowBar
    pendingDownFamilyCount := activeLowContextCount
    pendingDownMask := 0
    pendingDownPivotObservations := 0
    if lower1Index >= 0
        pendingDownOldestBar := array.get(clusterOldestBars, lower1Index)
        pendingDownMask := array.get(clusterMasks, lower1Index)
        pendingDownPivotObservations := array.get(clusterPivotObservations, lower1Index)
    pendingDownFingerprint := activeLowFingerprint
    array.clear(pendingDownSourceIds)
    if lower1Index >= 0 and array.size(memberClusters) > 0
        for m = 0 to array.size(memberClusters) - 1
            if array.get(memberClusters, m) == lower1Index
                array.push(pendingDownSourceIds, array.get(levelSources, array.get(memberSources, m)).id)
    pendingDownClearance := (monitoredLow - close) / atr
    pendingDownRangeAtr := (high - low) / atr
    pendingDownBodyRatio := high != low ? math.abs(close - open) / (high - low) : na
    pendingDownVolumeMultiple := volumeMultiple
    pendingDownAtr := atr
    pendingDownClose := close
    pendingDownInsideSession := insideSession

if barstate.isconfirmed and effectiveConfirmBars > 0
    evtUpOneRemaining := not na(pendingUpBar) and bar_index - pendingUpBar == effectiveConfirmBars - 1 and close > pendingUpLevel
    evtDownOneRemaining := not na(pendingDownBar) and bar_index - pendingDownBar == effectiveConfirmBars - 1 and close < pendingDownLevel

// Bar-scoped confirmed-event fields.
bool breakUp = false
bool breakDown = false
float upBreakLevel = na
float downBreakLevel = na
int upBreakLevelBar = na
int downBreakLevelBar = na
int upBreakFamilyCount = 0
int downBreakFamilyCount = 0
int upBreakMask = 0
int downBreakMask = 0
int upBreakPivotObservations = 0
int downBreakPivotObservations = 0
int upCandidateBar = na
int downCandidateBar = na
float candidateClearance = na
float candidateRangeAtr = na
float candidateBodyRatio = na
float candidateVolumeMultiple = na
float candidateAtr = na
float candidateClose = na
bool candidateInsideSession = false
float confirmationClearance = na
int confirmationDelay = na

if barstate.isconfirmed and not na(pendingUpBar) and bar_index - pendingUpBar >= effectiveConfirmBars and close > pendingUpLevel
    breakUp := true
    upBreakLevel := pendingUpLevel
    upBreakLevelBar := pendingUpLevelBar
    upBreakFamilyCount := pendingUpFamilyCount
    upBreakMask := pendingUpMask
    upBreakPivotObservations := pendingUpPivotObservations
    upCandidateBar := pendingUpBar
    candidateClearance := pendingUpClearance
    candidateRangeAtr := pendingUpRangeAtr
    candidateBodyRatio := pendingUpBodyRatio
    candidateVolumeMultiple := pendingUpVolumeMultiple
    candidateAtr := pendingUpAtr
    candidateClose := pendingUpClose
    candidateInsideSession := pendingUpInsideSession
    confirmationClearance := atr > 0 ? (close - pendingUpLevel) / atr : na
    confirmationDelay := bar_index - pendingUpBar
    if array.size(levelSources) > 0 and array.size(pendingUpSourceIds) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(levelSources) - 1
            LevelSource source = array.get(levelSources, i)
            if array.includes(pendingUpSourceIds, source.id)
                source.consumed := true
                array.set(levelSources, i, source)
    pendingUpBar := na
    array.clear(pendingUpSourceIds)

if barstate.isconfirmed and not na(pendingDownBar) and bar_index - pendingDownBar >= effectiveConfirmBars and close < pendingDownLevel
    breakDown := true
    downBreakLevel := pendingDownLevel
    downBreakLevelBar := pendingDownLevelBar
    downBreakFamilyCount := pendingDownFamilyCount
    downBreakMask := pendingDownMask
    downBreakPivotObservations := pendingDownPivotObservations
    downCandidateBar := pendingDownBar
    // A simultaneous opposite confirmation is abnormal; the down event becomes
    // the representative export while the separate direction flags preserve both.
    candidateClearance := pendingDownClearance
    candidateRangeAtr := pendingDownRangeAtr
    candidateBodyRatio := pendingDownBodyRatio
    candidateVolumeMultiple := pendingDownVolumeMultiple
    candidateAtr := pendingDownAtr
    candidateClose := pendingDownClose
    candidateInsideSession := pendingDownInsideSession
    confirmationClearance := atr > 0 ? (pendingDownLevel - close) / atr : na
    confirmationDelay := bar_index - pendingDownBar
    if array.size(levelSources) > 0 and array.size(pendingDownSourceIds) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(levelSources) - 1
            LevelSource source = array.get(levelSources, i)
            if array.includes(pendingDownSourceIds, source.id)
                source.consumed := true
                array.set(levelSources, i, source)
    pendingDownBar := na
    array.clear(pendingDownSourceIds)

// Retire any unpinned source that a completed close has already cleared by
// the effective ATR clearance. Pending constituent IDs are excluded until the
// candidate either cancels or confirms, preserving its frozen calculation.
if barstate.isconfirmed and atr > 0 and array.size(levelSources) > 0
    for i = 0 to array.size(levelSources) - 1
        LevelSource source = array.get(levelSources, i)
        bool pinned = array.includes(pendingUpSourceIds, source.id) or array.includes(pendingDownSourceIds, source.id)
        bool cleared = source.side == 1 ? close > source.price + atr * effectiveMinClearance : close < source.price - atr * effectiveMinClearance
        if not source.consumed and not pinned and cleared
            source.consumed := true
            array.set(levelSources, i, source)

bool anyBreak = breakUp or breakDown
bool visibleBreakUp = breakUp and eventVisibleNow
bool visibleBreakDown = breakDown and eventVisibleNow
bool anyVisibleBreak = visibleBreakUp or visibleBreakDown
string breakType = breakUp and breakDown ? "UP + DOWN" : breakUp ? "ABOVE" : breakDown ? "BELOW" : ""
int breakFamilyCount = breakUp and not breakDown ? upBreakFamilyCount : breakDown and not breakUp ? downBreakFamilyCount : 0
float breakLevel = breakUp and not breakDown ? upBreakLevel : breakDown and not breakUp ? downBreakLevel : na
int breakLevelBar = breakUp and not breakDown ? upBreakLevelBar : breakDown and not breakUp ? downBreakLevelBar : na
int candidateBar = breakUp and not breakDown ? upCandidateBar : breakDown and not breakUp ? downCandidateBar : na

// Hide a just-confirmed frozen cluster immediately. Its consumed components
// are removed from the registry on the next bar's cluster rebuild.
if breakUp
    activeHigh := na
    activeHighBar := na
    highInBand := false
if breakDown
    activeLow := na
    activeLowBar := na
    lowInBand := false

// Refresh bar-scoped structure facts after a confirmation may have cleared one
// side. The snapshot comparison above remains the last complete pivot pair.
float keyAbove1 = not na(pendingUpBar) ? pendingUpLevel : activeHigh
float keyBelow1 = not na(pendingDownBar) ? pendingDownLevel : activeLow
highDistance := not na(keyAbove1) and atr > 0 ? (keyAbove1 - close) / atr : na
lowDistance := not na(keyBelow1) and atr > 0 ? (close - keyBelow1) / atr : na
structureTop := not na(keyAbove1) and not na(keyBelow1) ? math.max(keyAbove1, keyBelow1) : na
structureBottom := not na(keyAbove1) and not na(keyBelow1) ? math.min(keyAbove1, keyBelow1) : na
structureWidth := not na(structureTop) ? structureTop - structureBottom : na
structureWidthAtr := not na(structureWidth) and atr > 0 ? structureWidth / atr : na
structurePosition := not na(structureWidth) and structureWidth > 0 ? 100.0 * (close - structureBottom) / structureWidth : na
activeHighAge := na(activeHighBar) ? na : bar_index - activeHighBar
activeLowAge := na(activeLowBar) ? na : bar_index - activeLowBar
nearestBoundary := na(highDistance) ? (na(lowDistance) ? 0 : -1) : na(lowDistance) ? 1 : math.abs(highDistance) <= math.abs(lowDistance) ? 1 : -1

// ───────────────────────────── Broken-level returns ────────────────────────
var array<float> returnLevels = array.new_float(0)
var array<int> returnBreakBars = array.new_int(0)
var array<int> returnDirections = array.new_int(0)  // 1 = broken upward, -1 = broken downward
var array<bool> returnArmed = array.new_bool(0)
var array<bool> returnInBand = array.new_bool(0)
var array<int> returnLastBars = array.new_int(0)
var int expiredBrokenLevels = 0
var int capacityDroppedLevels = 0

bool returnFromAbove = false
bool returnFromBelow = false
float returnedLevel = na
int returnsThisBar = 0
bool evtBrokenLevelArmedUp = false
bool evtBrokenLevelArmedDown = false
bool evtBrokenLevelApproachUp = false
bool evtBrokenLevelApproachDown = false
float armedBrokenLevelUp = na
float armedBrokenLevelDown = na
float approachedBrokenLevelUp = na
float approachedBrokenLevelDown = na

if barstate.isconfirmed and array.size(returnLevels) > 0
    for i = array.size(returnLevels) - 1 to 0
        int breakBar = array.get(returnBreakBars, i)
        if bar_index - breakBar > returnMaxAge
            array.remove(returnLevels, i)
            array.remove(returnBreakBars, i)
            array.remove(returnDirections, i)
            array.remove(returnArmed, i)
            array.remove(returnInBand, i)
            array.remove(returnLastBars, i)
            expiredBrokenLevels += 1
        else if atr > 0
            float lvl = array.get(returnLevels, i)
            int dir = array.get(returnDirections, i)
            bool armed = array.get(returnArmed, i)
            bool wasInBand = array.get(returnInBand, i)
            int lastReturnBar = array.get(returnLastBars, i)
            float band = atr * returnBand
            bool movedAway = dir == 1 ? close > lvl + band : close < lvl - band
            if movedAway and not armed
                armed := true
                if dir == 1
                    evtBrokenLevelArmedUp := true
                    armedBrokenLevelUp := lvl
                else
                    evtBrokenLevelArmedDown := true
                    armedBrokenLevelDown := lvl
            bool touching = high >= lvl - band and low <= lvl + band
            if touching and not wasInBand and bar_index - breakBar >= returnMinAge
                if dir == 1
                    evtBrokenLevelApproachUp := true
                    approachedBrokenLevelUp := lvl
                else
                    evtBrokenLevelApproachDown := true
                    approachedBrokenLevelDown := lvl
            bool cooldownReady = na(lastReturnBar) or bar_index - lastReturnBar >= returnCooldown
            bool closedOnBrokenSide = dir == 1 ? close >= lvl : close <= lvl
            bool fired = armed and touching and not wasInBand and cooldownReady and bar_index - breakBar >= returnMinAge and closedOnBrokenSide
            if fired
                returnsThisBar += 1
                if dir == 1
                    returnFromAbove := true
                else
                    returnFromBelow := true
                if na(returnedLevel) or math.abs(close - lvl) < math.abs(close - returnedLevel)
                    returnedLevel := lvl
                lastReturnBar := bar_index
                armed := false
            array.set(returnArmed, i, armed)
            array.set(returnInBand, i, touching)
            array.set(returnLastBars, i, lastReturnBar)

// Add newly confirmed breaks after processing older records, so a break cannot
// also become its own return event on the same candle.
if breakUp
    array.push(returnLevels, upBreakLevel)
    array.push(returnBreakBars, bar_index)
    array.push(returnDirections, 1)
    array.push(returnArmed, false)
    array.push(returnInBand, true)
    array.push(returnLastBars, na)
if breakDown
    array.push(returnLevels, downBreakLevel)
    array.push(returnBreakBars, bar_index)
    array.push(returnDirections, -1)
    array.push(returnArmed, false)
    array.push(returnInBand, true)
    array.push(returnLastBars, na)

while array.size(returnLevels) > maxTrackedBrokenLevels
    array.shift(returnLevels)
    array.shift(returnBreakBars)
    array.shift(returnDirections)
    array.shift(returnArmed)
    array.shift(returnInBand)
    array.shift(returnLastBars)
    capacityDroppedLevels += 1

bool visibleReturnFromAbove = returnFromAbove and eventVisibleNow
bool visibleReturnFromBelow = returnFromBelow and eventVisibleNow
plotshape(showReturns and visibleReturnFromAbove, "Return to upward-broken level", shape.triangleup, location.belowbar, color = color.aqua, size = size.tiny)
plotshape(showReturns and visibleReturnFromBelow, "Return to downward-broken level", shape.triangledown, location.abovebar, color = color.orange, size = size.tiny)

// ───────────────────────────── Event evidence ──────────────────────────────
// Break samples begin on the confirmation close. Their ATR unit is frozen on
// that bar, so later volatility cannot rewrite earlier excursion measurements.
var array<ActiveEvidence> activeEvidence = array.new<ActiveEvidence>(0)
var array<EvidenceResult> completedEvidence = array.new<EvidenceResult>(0)
var array<BaselineResult> completedBaseline = array.new<BaselineResult>(0)
var int baselineWriteIndex = 0

bool evidenceResolved = false
float resolvedMfeShort = na
float resolvedMaeShort = na
float resolvedFinalShort = na
int resolvedFirstShort = na
float resolvedMfeMedium = na
float resolvedMaeMedium = na
float resolvedFinalMedium = na
int resolvedFirstMedium = na
float resolvedMfeLong = na
float resolvedMaeLong = na
float resolvedFinalLong = na
int resolvedFirstLong = na
int resolvedReturnAge = na
bool resolvedCrossedBack = false

if enableEvidence and barstate.isconfirmed and array.size(activeEvidence) > 0
    for i = array.size(activeEvidence) - 1 to 0
        ActiveEvidence s = array.get(activeEvidence, i)
        int age = bar_index - s.startBar
        if age > 0 and s.baseAtr > 0
            float favorableNow = s.direction == 1 ? (high - s.anchor) / s.baseAtr : (s.anchor - low) / s.baseAtr
            float adverseNow = s.direction == 1 ? (s.anchor - low) / s.baseAtr : (high - s.anchor) / s.baseAtr
            s.maxFavorable := math.max(s.maxFavorable, favorableNow)
            s.maxAdverse := math.max(s.maxAdverse, adverseNow)

            if s.firstOutcome == 0
                bool favorableHit = favorableNow >= evidenceThreshold
                bool adverseHit = adverseNow >= evidenceThreshold
                if favorableHit and adverseHit
                    s.firstOutcome := 2
                else if favorableHit
                    s.firstOutcome := 1
                else if adverseHit
                    s.firstOutcome := -1

            float evidenceReturnBand = atr * returnBand
            bool movedAway = s.direction == 1 ? close > s.level + evidenceReturnBand : close < s.level - evidenceReturnBand
            if movedAway
                s.returnArmed := true
            bool touchingLevel = high >= s.level - evidenceReturnBand and low <= s.level + evidenceReturnBand
            bool closedOnBrokenSide = s.direction == 1 ? close >= s.level : close <= s.level
            if na(s.returnAge) and age >= returnMinAge and s.returnArmed and touchingLevel and not s.returnInBand and closedOnBrokenSide
                s.returnAge := age
                s.returnArmed := false
            s.returnInBand := touchingLevel
            if s.direction == 1 and close < s.level
                s.crossedBack := true
            if s.direction == -1 and close > s.level
                s.crossedBack := true

            float finalNow = s.direction * (close - s.anchor) / s.baseAtr
            if age == evidenceShort
                s.mfeShort := s.maxFavorable
                s.maeShort := s.maxAdverse
                s.finalShort := finalNow
                s.firstShort := s.firstOutcome
            if age == evidenceMedium
                s.mfeMedium := s.maxFavorable
                s.maeMedium := s.maxAdverse
                s.finalMedium := finalNow
                s.firstMedium := s.firstOutcome

            if age >= evidenceLong
                EvidenceResult r = EvidenceResult.new()
                r.direction := s.direction
                r.familyCount := s.familyCount
                r.inSession := s.inSession
                r.atrRegime := s.atrRegime
                r.clearanceRegime := s.clearanceRegime
                r.volumeRegime := s.volumeRegime
                r.delayRegime := s.delayRegime
                r.mfeShort := s.mfeShort
                r.maeShort := s.maeShort
                r.finalShort := s.finalShort
                r.firstShort := s.firstShort
                r.mfeMedium := s.mfeMedium
                r.maeMedium := s.maeMedium
                r.finalMedium := s.finalMedium
                r.firstMedium := s.firstMedium
                r.mfeLong := s.maxFavorable
                r.maeLong := s.maxAdverse
                r.finalLong := finalNow
                r.firstLong := s.firstOutcome
                r.returnAge := s.returnAge
                r.crossedBack := s.crossedBack
                array.push(completedEvidence, r)

                evidenceResolved := true
                resolvedMfeShort := r.mfeShort
                resolvedMaeShort := r.maeShort
                resolvedFinalShort := r.finalShort
                resolvedFirstShort := r.firstShort
                resolvedMfeMedium := r.mfeMedium
                resolvedMaeMedium := r.maeMedium
                resolvedFinalMedium := r.finalMedium
                resolvedFirstMedium := r.firstMedium
                resolvedMfeLong := r.mfeLong
                resolvedMaeLong := r.maeLong
                resolvedFinalLong := r.finalLong
                resolvedFirstLong := r.firstLong
                resolvedReturnAge := r.returnAge
                resolvedCrossedBack := r.crossedBack
                array.remove(activeEvidence, i)
            else
                array.set(activeEvidence, i, s)

while array.size(completedEvidence) > maxEvidenceSamples
    array.shift(completedEvidence)

// Add the current confirmation only after older samples have updated, so the
// confirmation candle is never included in its own forward window.
if enableEvidence and anyBreak and not (breakUp and breakDown) and atr > 0
    ActiveEvidence s = ActiveEvidence.new()
    s.startBar := bar_index
    s.direction := breakUp ? 1 : -1
    s.familyCount := breakFamilyCount
    s.inSession := insideSession
    s.atrRegime := atrBucket(atrPct)
    s.clearanceRegime := clearanceBucket(candidateClearance)
    s.volumeRegime := volumeBucket(candidateVolumeMultiple)
    s.delayRegime := delayBucket(confirmationDelay)
    s.anchor := close
    s.level := breakLevel
    s.baseAtr := atr
    s.maxFavorable := 0.0
    s.maxAdverse := 0.0
    s.firstOutcome := 0
    s.returnArmed := false
    s.returnInBand := true
    s.returnAge := na
    s.crossedBack := false
    array.push(activeEvidence, s)

// One non-break observation resolves on every completed bar after the longest
// horizon. These are not shifted-price pseudo levels: they are actual bars from
// the same instrument, matched later by session and ATR regime.
float baselineHighestShort = ta.highest(high, evidenceShort)
float baselineLowestShort = ta.lowest(low, evidenceShort)
float baselineHighestMedium = ta.highest(high, evidenceMedium)
float baselineLowestMedium = ta.lowest(low, evidenceMedium)
float baselineHighestLong = ta.highest(high, evidenceLong)
float baselineLowestLong = ta.lowest(low, evidenceLong)

if enableEvidence and barstate.isconfirmed and bar_index >= evidenceLong
    float baselineAnchor = close[evidenceLong]
    float baselineAtr = atr[evidenceLong]
    bool baselineStartWasBreak = anyBreak[evidenceLong]
    if not baselineStartWasBreak and not na(baselineAnchor) and baselineAtr > 0
        int shortOffset = evidenceLong - evidenceShort
        int mediumOffset = evidenceLong - evidenceMedium
        BaselineResult b = BaselineResult.new()
        b.inSession := insideSession[evidenceLong]
        b.atrRegime := atrBucket(atrPct[evidenceLong])
        b.upMfeShort := math.max(0.0, (baselineHighestShort[shortOffset] - baselineAnchor) / baselineAtr)
        b.upMaeShort := math.max(0.0, (baselineAnchor - baselineLowestShort[shortOffset]) / baselineAtr)
        b.upMfeMedium := math.max(0.0, (baselineHighestMedium[mediumOffset] - baselineAnchor) / baselineAtr)
        b.upMaeMedium := math.max(0.0, (baselineAnchor - baselineLowestMedium[mediumOffset]) / baselineAtr)
        b.upMfeLong := math.max(0.0, (baselineHighestLong - baselineAnchor) / baselineAtr)
        b.upMaeLong := math.max(0.0, (baselineAnchor - baselineLowestLong) / baselineAtr)
        if array.size(completedBaseline) < maxBaselineSamples
            array.push(completedBaseline, b)
        else
            array.set(completedBaseline, baselineWriteIndex, b)
            baselineWriteIndex := (baselineWriteIndex + 1) % maxBaselineSamples

var int latestEvidenceDirection = 0
var int latestEvidenceFamilyCount = 0
var bool latestEvidenceSession = false
var int latestEvidenceAtrRegime = -1
var int latestEvidenceClearanceRegime = -1
var int latestEvidenceVolumeRegime = -1
var int latestEvidenceDelayRegime = -1
if anyBreak and not (breakUp and breakDown)
    latestEvidenceDirection := breakUp ? 1 : -1
    latestEvidenceFamilyCount := breakFamilyCount
    latestEvidenceSession := insideSession
    latestEvidenceAtrRegime := atrBucket(atrPct)
    latestEvidenceClearanceRegime := clearanceBucket(candidateClearance)
    latestEvidenceVolumeRegime := volumeBucket(candidateVolumeMultiple)
    latestEvidenceDelayRegime := delayBucket(confirmationDelay)

// ───────────────────────────── Active-level evidence ───────────────────────
// Only the first approach to each confirmed structural level starts a sample.
// The approach bar itself is excluded. A high reacts downward; a low reacts
// upward. A completed close through the opposite threshold is the competing
// outcome. Both on one bar is ambiguous; neither by the horizon is unresolved.
var array<ActiveLevelReaction> activeLevelReactions = array.new<ActiveLevelReaction>(0)
var array<LevelReactionResult> completedLevelReactions = array.new<LevelReactionResult>(0)
var array<LevelBaselineResult> completedLevelBaselines = array.new<LevelBaselineResult>(0)

if enableLevelEvidence and barstate.isconfirmed and array.size(activeLevelReactions) > 0
    for i = array.size(activeLevelReactions) - 1 to 0
        ActiveLevelReaction s = array.get(activeLevelReactions, i)
        int age = bar_index - s.startBar
        if age > 0 and s.baseAtr > 0
            bool reactionHit = s.direction == -1 ? low <= s.level - levelReactionThreshold * s.baseAtr : high >= s.level + levelReactionThreshold * s.baseAtr
            bool failureHit = s.direction == -1 ? close > s.level + levelFailureThreshold * s.baseAtr : close < s.level - levelFailureThreshold * s.baseAtr
            int outcome = reactionHit and failureHit ? 2 : reactionHit ? 1 : failureHit ? -1 : 0
            bool resolved = outcome != 0 or age >= levelEvidenceHorizon
            if resolved
                LevelReactionResult r = LevelReactionResult.new()
                r.direction := s.direction
                r.contextCount := s.contextCount
                r.inSession := s.inSession
                r.atrRegime := s.atrRegime
                r.outcome := outcome
                array.push(completedLevelReactions, r)
                array.remove(activeLevelReactions, i)

while array.size(completedLevelReactions) > maxLevelEvidenceSamples
    array.shift(completedLevelReactions)

// Add new samples after older ones update so the approach candle cannot count
// as a reaction or close-through observation.
if enableLevelEvidence and evtApproachHigh and not activeHighEvidenceStarted and atr > 0
    ActiveLevelReaction s = ActiveLevelReaction.new()
    s.startBar := bar_index
    s.direction := -1
    s.contextCount := approachedHighContextCount
    s.inSession := approachedHighBirthSession
    s.atrRegime := approachedHighBirthAtrRegime
    s.level := approachedActiveHighLevel
    s.baseAtr := atr
    array.push(activeLevelReactions, s)
    activeHighEvidenceStarted := true

if enableLevelEvidence and evtApproachLow and not activeLowEvidenceStarted and atr > 0
    ActiveLevelReaction s = ActiveLevelReaction.new()
    s.startBar := bar_index
    s.direction := 1
    s.contextCount := approachedLowContextCount
    s.inSession := approachedLowBirthSession
    s.atrRegime := approachedLowBirthAtrRegime
    s.level := approachedActiveLowLevel
    s.baseAtr := atr
    array.push(activeLevelReactions, s)
    activeLowEvidenceStarted := true

// Ordinary chart bars use the same frozen ATR, direction, thresholds, horizon,
// session state, ATR regime, and first-hit ordering. Starts that were themselves
// structural approaches on that side are excluded from the baseline.
if enableLevelEvidence and barstate.isconfirmed and bar_index >= levelEvidenceHorizon
    float baseLevel = close[levelEvidenceHorizon]
    float baseAtr = atr[levelEvidenceHorizon]
    if not na(baseLevel) and baseAtr > 0
        int highOutcome = 0
        int lowOutcome = 0
        for step = 1 to levelEvidenceHorizon
            int offset = levelEvidenceHorizon - step
            if highOutcome == 0
                bool highReaction = low[offset] <= baseLevel - levelReactionThreshold * baseAtr
                bool highFailure = close[offset] > baseLevel + levelFailureThreshold * baseAtr
                highOutcome := highReaction and highFailure ? 2 : highReaction ? 1 : highFailure ? -1 : 0
            if lowOutcome == 0
                bool lowReaction = high[offset] >= baseLevel + levelReactionThreshold * baseAtr
                bool lowFailure = close[offset] < baseLevel - levelFailureThreshold * baseAtr
                lowOutcome := lowReaction and lowFailure ? 2 : lowReaction ? 1 : lowFailure ? -1 : 0
        if not evtApproachHigh[levelEvidenceHorizon]
            LevelBaselineResult b = LevelBaselineResult.new()
            b.direction := -1
            b.inSession := insideSession[levelEvidenceHorizon]
            b.atrRegime := atrBucket(atrPct[levelEvidenceHorizon])
            b.outcome := highOutcome
            array.push(completedLevelBaselines, b)
        if not evtApproachLow[levelEvidenceHorizon]
            LevelBaselineResult b = LevelBaselineResult.new()
            b.direction := 1
            b.inSession := insideSession[levelEvidenceHorizon]
            b.atrRegime := atrBucket(atrPct[levelEvidenceHorizon])
            b.outcome := lowOutcome
            array.push(completedLevelBaselines, b)

while array.size(completedLevelBaselines) > maxLevelEvidenceSamples * 3
    array.shift(completedLevelBaselines)

int highLevelStatus = na(activeHigh) ? -1 : 0
int lowLevelStatus = na(activeLow) ? -1 : 0
int highLevelN = 0
int lowLevelN = 0
int highBaseN = 0
int lowBaseN = 0
float highLevelRate = na
float lowLevelRate = na
float highBaseRate = na
float lowBaseRate = na
float highLevelLower = na
float highLevelUpper = na
float lowLevelLower = na
float lowLevelUpper = na
int highCohortMode = 0
int lowCohortMode = 0

if barstate.islast and enableLevelEvidence and not na(activeHigh)
    [calcStatus, calcN, calcBaseN, calcRate, calcBaseRate, calcLower, calcUpper, calcMode] = levelEvidenceSummary(completedLevelReactions, completedLevelBaselines, -1, activeHighContextCount, activeHighBirthSession, activeHighBirthAtrRegime, minLevelEvidenceSamples)
    highLevelStatus := calcStatus
    highLevelN := calcN
    highBaseN := calcBaseN
    highLevelRate := calcRate
    highBaseRate := calcBaseRate
    highLevelLower := calcLower
    highLevelUpper := calcUpper
    highCohortMode := calcMode

if barstate.islast and enableLevelEvidence and not na(activeLow)
    [calcStatus, calcN, calcBaseN, calcRate, calcBaseRate, calcLower, calcUpper, calcMode] = levelEvidenceSummary(completedLevelReactions, completedLevelBaselines, 1, activeLowContextCount, activeLowBirthSession, activeLowBirthAtrRegime, minLevelEvidenceSamples)
    lowLevelStatus := calcStatus
    lowLevelN := calcN
    lowBaseN := calcBaseN
    lowLevelRate := calcRate
    lowBaseRate := calcBaseRate
    lowLevelLower := calcLower
    lowLevelUpper := calcUpper
    lowCohortMode := calcMode

string highLevelStatusName = not enableLevelEvidence ? "Evidence disabled" : levelStatusName(highLevelStatus)
string lowLevelStatusName = not enableLevelEvidence ? "Evidence disabled" : levelStatusName(lowLevelStatus)
string highLevelEvidenceText = na(activeHigh) ? "Waiting for Above 1" : not enableLevelEvidence ? "Evidence collection disabled" : highLevelStatus == 0 ? "Evidence building: " + str.tostring(highLevelN) + " of " + str.tostring(minLevelEvidenceSamples) + " clusters · base " + str.tostring(highBaseN) : highLevelStatusName + " · cluster " + str.tostring(100.0 * highLevelRate, "#") + "% / base " + str.tostring(100.0 * highBaseRate, "#") + "% · n " + str.tostring(highLevelN) + "/" + str.tostring(highBaseN)
string lowLevelEvidenceText = na(activeLow) ? "Waiting for Below 1" : not enableLevelEvidence ? "Evidence collection disabled" : lowLevelStatus == 0 ? "Evidence building: " + str.tostring(lowLevelN) + " of " + str.tostring(minLevelEvidenceSamples) + " clusters · base " + str.tostring(lowBaseN) : lowLevelStatusName + " · cluster " + str.tostring(100.0 * lowLevelRate, "#") + "% / base " + str.tostring(100.0 * lowBaseRate, "#") + "% · n " + str.tostring(lowLevelN) + "/" + str.tostring(lowBaseN)
string highLevelEvidenceTooltip = na(activeHigh) ? "No Above 1 cluster is available." : not enableLevelEvidence ? "Key-level evidence collection is disabled." : highLevelStatus == 0 ? "Classification waits for " + str.tostring(minLevelEvidenceSamples) + " completed cluster observations and ordinary-bar observations. Cohort: " + levelCohortName(highCohortMode) + ". Families: " + activeHighContextTags + ". Historical and in-sample; not a prediction or paired-placebo validation." : "Above-cluster first-approach reaction / ordinary-bar reaction. 95% difference interval: " + str.tostring(100.0 * highLevelLower, "#.0") + " to " + str.tostring(100.0 * highLevelUpper, "#.0") + " percentage points. Cohort: " + levelCohortName(highCohortMode) + ". Families: " + activeHighContextTags + ". Historical and in-sample; not a prediction or paired-placebo validation."
string lowLevelEvidenceTooltip = na(activeLow) ? "No Below 1 cluster is available." : not enableLevelEvidence ? "Key-level evidence collection is disabled." : lowLevelStatus == 0 ? "Classification waits for " + str.tostring(minLevelEvidenceSamples) + " completed cluster observations and ordinary-bar observations. Cohort: " + levelCohortName(lowCohortMode) + ". Families: " + activeLowContextTags + ". Historical and in-sample; not a prediction or paired-placebo validation." : "Below-cluster first-approach reaction / ordinary-bar reaction. 95% difference interval: " + str.tostring(100.0 * lowLevelLower, "#.0") + " to " + str.tostring(100.0 * lowLevelUpper, "#.0") + " percentage points. Cohort: " + levelCohortName(lowCohortMode) + ". Families: " + activeLowContextTags + ". Historical and in-sample; not a prediction or paired-placebo validation."

// ───────────────────────────── Historical break drawings ──────────────────
var array<line> breakLines = array.new_line(0)
var array<label> breakLabels = array.new_label(0)

if visibleBreakUp and historyCount > 0
    line l = line.new(upBreakLevelBar, upBreakLevel, bar_index, upBreakLevel, color = color.aqua, width = lineWidth)
    array.push(breakLines, l)
    if showBreakLabels
        float upConfirmNow = atr > 0 ? (close - upBreakLevel) / atr : na
        label b = label.new(bar_index, high, "Closed above key level · " + str.tostring(upBreakFamilyCount) + " refs · initial " + str.tostring(candidateClearance, "#.##") + " ATR · confirm " + str.tostring(upConfirmNow, "#.##") + " ATR",
             style = label.style_label_down, color = color.new(color.black, 20), textcolor = color.aqua, size = size.tiny)
        pushBoundedLabel(breakLabels, b, historyCount)

if visibleBreakDown and historyCount > 0
    line l = line.new(downBreakLevelBar, downBreakLevel, bar_index, downBreakLevel, color = color.orange, width = lineWidth)
    array.push(breakLines, l)
    if showBreakLabels
        float downConfirmNow = atr > 0 ? (downBreakLevel - close) / atr : na
        label b = label.new(bar_index, low, "Closed below key level · " + str.tostring(downBreakFamilyCount) + " refs · initial " + str.tostring(candidateClearance, "#.##") + " ATR · confirm " + str.tostring(downConfirmNow, "#.##") + " ATR",
             style = label.style_label_up, color = color.new(color.black, 20), textcolor = color.orange, size = size.tiny)
        pushBoundedLabel(breakLabels, b, historyCount)

while array.size(breakLines) > historyCount
    line.delete(array.shift(breakLines))

// ───────────────────────────── Key-level drawings ─────────────────────────
var array<line> keyLines = array.new_line(0)
var array<label> keyTags = array.new_label(0)

if barstate.islast
    if array.size(keyLines) > 0
        for i = array.size(keyLines) - 1 to 0
            line.delete(array.get(keyLines, i))
    if array.size(keyTags) > 0
        for i = array.size(keyTags) - 1 to 0
            label.delete(array.get(keyTags, i))
    array.clear(keyLines)
    array.clear(keyTags)
    if showLiveLevels
        for rank = 0 to levelsPerSide - 1
            bool upperAvailable = rank < array.size(selectedUpper) or (rank == 0 and not na(pendingUpBar))
            if upperAvailable
                float levelPrice = na
                int families = 0
                int mask = 0
                int pivots = 0
                int newest = na
                int oldest = na
                if rank == 0 and not na(pendingUpBar)
                    levelPrice := pendingUpLevel
                    families := pendingUpFamilyCount
                    mask := pendingUpMask
                    pivots := pendingUpPivotObservations
                    newest := pendingUpLevelBar
                    oldest := pendingUpOldestBar
                else
                    int c = array.get(selectedUpper, rank)
                    levelPrice := array.get(clusterPrices, c)
                    families := array.get(clusterFamilyCounts, c)
                    mask := array.get(clusterMasks, c)
                    pivots := array.get(clusterPivotObservations, c)
                    newest := array.get(clusterNewestBars, c)
                    oldest := array.get(clusterOldestBars, c)
                int transparency = families >= 3 ? 15 : families == 2 ? 35 : 55
                int width = math.min(4, lineWidth + families - 1)
                string evidence = rank == 0 ? highLevelEvidenceText : "Shown in dashboard for the monitored level only"
                string tooltip = keyLevelTooltip(levelPrice, families, mask, pivots, newest, oldest, atr, keyClusterTolerance, evidence)
                array.push(keyLines, line.new(oldest, levelPrice, bar_index + 20, levelPrice, color = color.new(color.aqua, transparency), style = line.style_dotted, width = width))
                if showLevelTags
                    array.push(keyTags, label.new(bar_index + 20, levelPrice, "Above " + str.tostring(rank + 1) + " · " + str.tostring(levelPrice, format.mintick) + " · " + str.tostring(families) + " refs", style = label.style_label_left, color = color.new(color.black, 20), textcolor = color.aqua, size = size.tiny, tooltip = tooltip))
            bool lowerAvailable = rank < array.size(selectedLower) or (rank == 0 and not na(pendingDownBar))
            if lowerAvailable
                float levelPrice = na
                int families = 0
                int mask = 0
                int pivots = 0
                int newest = na
                int oldest = na
                if rank == 0 and not na(pendingDownBar)
                    levelPrice := pendingDownLevel
                    families := pendingDownFamilyCount
                    mask := pendingDownMask
                    pivots := pendingDownPivotObservations
                    newest := pendingDownLevelBar
                    oldest := pendingDownOldestBar
                else
                    int c = array.get(selectedLower, rank)
                    levelPrice := array.get(clusterPrices, c)
                    families := array.get(clusterFamilyCounts, c)
                    mask := array.get(clusterMasks, c)
                    pivots := array.get(clusterPivotObservations, c)
                    newest := array.get(clusterNewestBars, c)
                    oldest := array.get(clusterOldestBars, c)
                int transparency = families >= 3 ? 15 : families == 2 ? 35 : 55
                int width = math.min(4, lineWidth + families - 1)
                string evidence = rank == 0 ? lowLevelEvidenceText : "Shown in dashboard for the monitored level only"
                string tooltip = keyLevelTooltip(levelPrice, families, mask, pivots, newest, oldest, atr, keyClusterTolerance, evidence)
                array.push(keyLines, line.new(oldest, levelPrice, bar_index + 20, levelPrice, color = color.new(color.orange, transparency), style = line.style_dotted, width = width))
                if showLevelTags
                    array.push(keyTags, label.new(bar_index + 20, levelPrice, "Below " + str.tostring(rank + 1) + " · " + str.tostring(levelPrice, format.mintick) + " · " + str.tostring(families) + " refs", style = label.style_label_left, color = color.new(color.black, 20), textcolor = color.orange, size = size.tiny, tooltip = tooltip))

// ───────────────────────────── Facts table ─────────────────────────────────
tablePositionResolved = tablePositionOf(tablePosition)
var table facts = table.new(tablePositionResolved, 2, 30, border_width = 1, border_color = color.new(color.gray, 70))
var string latestType = "—"
var float latestLevel = na
var float latestInitialClearance = na
var float latestConfirmClearance = na
var int latestBreakBar = na
var int latestCandidateDelay = na
var bool latestCandidateSession = false
var bool latestConfirmationSession = false
var int latestFamilyCount = 0

if anyBreak
    latestType := breakType
    latestLevel := breakLevel
    latestInitialClearance := candidateClearance
    latestConfirmClearance := confirmationClearance
    latestBreakBar := bar_index
    latestCandidateDelay := confirmationDelay
    latestCandidateSession := candidateInsideSession
    latestConfirmationSession := insideSession
    latestFamilyCount := breakFamilyCount

// Build one last-bar cohort summary for the guided dashboard and the optional
// Research evidence table. No difference is labelled an edge.
var array<float> evMfeS = array.new_float(0)
var array<float> evMaeS = array.new_float(0)
var array<float> evMfeM = array.new_float(0)
var array<float> evMaeM = array.new_float(0)
var array<float> evMfeL = array.new_float(0)
var array<float> evMaeL = array.new_float(0)
var array<float> returnAges = array.new_float(0)
var array<float> baseMfeS = array.new_float(0)
var array<float> baseMaeS = array.new_float(0)
var array<float> baseMfeM = array.new_float(0)
var array<float> baseMaeM = array.new_float(0)
var array<float> baseMfeL = array.new_float(0)
var array<float> baseMaeL = array.new_float(0)
int firstFav = 0
int firstAdv = 0
int firstAmbiguous = 0
int firstNeither = 0
int crossedCount = 0

if barstate.islast and enableEvidence
    array.clear(evMfeS)
    array.clear(evMaeS)
    array.clear(evMfeM)
    array.clear(evMaeM)
    array.clear(evMfeL)
    array.clear(evMaeL)
    array.clear(returnAges)
    array.clear(baseMfeS)
    array.clear(baseMaeS)
    array.clear(baseMfeM)
    array.clear(baseMaeM)
    array.clear(baseMfeL)
    array.clear(baseMaeL)
    if array.size(completedEvidence) > 0 and latestEvidenceDirection != 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(completedEvidence) - 1
            EvidenceResult r = array.get(completedEvidence, i)
            bool match = r.direction == latestEvidenceDirection
            if evidenceCohort != "Side only"
                match := match and r.familyCount == latestEvidenceFamilyCount
            if evidenceCohort == "Family count + session" or evidenceCohort == "Family count + session + ATR" or evidenceCohort == "Full context"
                match := match and r.inSession == latestEvidenceSession
            if evidenceCohort == "Family count + session + ATR" or evidenceCohort == "Full context"
                match := match and r.atrRegime == latestEvidenceAtrRegime
            if evidenceCohort == "Full context"
                match := match and r.clearanceRegime == latestEvidenceClearanceRegime and r.volumeRegime == latestEvidenceVolumeRegime and r.delayRegime == latestEvidenceDelayRegime
            if match
                array.push(evMfeS, r.mfeShort)
                array.push(evMaeS, r.maeShort)
                array.push(evMfeM, r.mfeMedium)
                array.push(evMaeM, r.maeMedium)
                array.push(evMfeL, r.mfeLong)
                array.push(evMaeL, r.maeLong)
                if not na(r.returnAge)
                    array.push(returnAges, r.returnAge)
                if r.crossedBack
                    crossedCount += 1
                if r.firstLong == 1
                    firstFav += 1
                else if r.firstLong == -1
                    firstAdv += 1
                else if r.firstLong == 2
                    firstAmbiguous += 1
                else
                    firstNeither += 1

    if array.size(completedBaseline) > 0 and latestEvidenceDirection != 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(completedBaseline) - 1
            BaselineResult b = array.get(completedBaseline, i)
            bool match = true
            if evidenceCohort == "Family count + session" or evidenceCohort == "Family count + session + ATR" or evidenceCohort == "Full context"
                match := b.inSession == latestEvidenceSession
            if evidenceCohort == "Family count + session + ATR" or evidenceCohort == "Full context"
                match := match and b.atrRegime == latestEvidenceAtrRegime
            if match
                array.push(baseMfeS, latestEvidenceDirection == 1 ? b.upMfeShort : b.upMaeShort)
                array.push(baseMaeS, latestEvidenceDirection == 1 ? b.upMaeShort : b.upMfeShort)
                array.push(baseMfeM, latestEvidenceDirection == 1 ? b.upMfeMedium : b.upMaeMedium)
                array.push(baseMaeM, latestEvidenceDirection == 1 ? b.upMaeMedium : b.upMfeMedium)
                array.push(baseMfeL, latestEvidenceDirection == 1 ? b.upMfeLong : b.upMaeLong)
                array.push(baseMaeL, latestEvidenceDirection == 1 ? b.upMaeLong : b.upMfeLong)

int eventN = array.size(evMfeL)
int baselineN = array.size(baseMfeL)
bool sampleReady = eventN >= minEvidenceSamples
float medianEvMfeS = na
float medianBaseMfeS = na
float medianEvMfeM = na
float medianBaseMfeM = na
float medianEvMfeL = na
float medianBaseMfeL = na
float medianEvMaeL = na
float medianBaseMaeL = na
float medianReturnAge = na
if sampleReady and baselineN > 0
    medianEvMfeS := array.median(evMfeS)
    medianBaseMfeS := array.median(baseMfeS)
    medianEvMfeM := array.median(evMfeM)
    medianBaseMfeM := array.median(baseMfeM)
    medianEvMfeL := array.median(evMfeL)
    medianBaseMfeL := array.median(baseMfeL)
    medianEvMaeL := array.median(evMaeL)
    medianBaseMaeL := array.median(baseMaeL)
if array.size(returnAges) > 0
    medianReturnAge := array.median(returnAges)
string evidenceReadyTxt = not enableEvidence ? "Evidence collection disabled" : latestEvidenceDirection == 0 ? "No completed break yet" : sampleReady ? "Ready · " + str.tostring(eventN) + " breaks / " + str.tostring(baselineN) + " ordinary bars" : "Evidence building: " + str.tostring(eventN) + " of " + str.tostring(minEvidenceSamples) + " breaks"

// Guided current-state dashboard.
if barstate.islast
    table.clear(facts, 0, 0, 1, 29)
    if showTable
        color bg = color.new(color.black, 20)
        color sectionBg = color.new(color.gray, 78)
        string appliedTxt = structureProfile + " · pivot " + str.tostring(effectiveSwingLen) + " · clear " + str.tostring(effectiveMinClearance, "#.##") + " ATR · confirm " + str.tostring(effectiveConfirmBars)
        string pendingTxt = not na(pendingUpBar) and not na(pendingDownBar) ? "Up + down candidates active" : not na(pendingUpBar) ? "Up candidate · " + str.tostring(bar_index - pendingUpBar) + "/" + str.tostring(effectiveConfirmBars) + " bars" : not na(pendingDownBar) ? "Down candidate · " + str.tostring(bar_index - pendingDownBar) + "/" + str.tostring(effectiveConfirmBars) + " bars" : "No active candidate"
        string stateTxt = anyBreak ? (breakUp and breakDown ? "Confirmed through both monitored levels" : breakUp ? "Confirmed above key level" : "Confirmed below key level") : evtCandidateUpCanceled and evtCandidateDownCanceled ? "Above and below candidates canceled" : evtCandidateUpCanceled ? "Above candidate canceled" : evtCandidateDownCanceled ? "Below candidate canceled" : not na(pendingUpBar) or not na(pendingDownBar) ? pendingTxt : array.size(levelSources) == 0 ? "Building first key levels" : na(activeHigh) or na(activeLow) ? "Waiting for a qualified cluster on one side" : "Monitoring calculated key levels"
        color stateColor = anyBreak ? (breakUp and not breakDown ? color.aqua : breakDown and not breakUp ? color.orange : color.white) : not na(pendingUpBar) or not na(pendingDownBar) or evtCandidateUpCanceled or evtCandidateDownCanceled ? color.yellow : color.white
        float shownAbove1 = not na(pendingUpBar) ? pendingUpLevel : activeHigh
        float shownBelow1 = not na(pendingDownBar) ? pendingDownLevel : activeLow
        int shownAbove1Families = not na(pendingUpBar) ? pendingUpFamilyCount : activeHighContextCount
        int shownBelow1Families = not na(pendingDownBar) ? pendingDownFamilyCount : activeLowContextCount
        string highTxt = na(shownAbove1) ? "No qualified cluster" : str.tostring(shownAbove1, format.mintick) + " · " + str.tostring(shownAbove1Families) + " refs · " + str.tostring(math.abs(shownAbove1 - close) / atr, "#.##") + " ATR · " + str.tostring(highApproaches) + " approaches"
        string lowTxt = na(shownBelow1) ? "No qualified cluster" : str.tostring(shownBelow1, format.mintick) + " · " + str.tostring(shownBelow1Families) + " refs · " + str.tostring(math.abs(close - shownBelow1) / atr, "#.##") + " ATR · " + str.tostring(lowApproaches) + " approaches"
        string above2Txt = "No second qualified cluster"
        string below2Txt = "No second qualified cluster"
        if upper2Index >= 0
            above2Txt := str.tostring(keyAbove2, format.mintick) + " · " + str.tostring(array.get(clusterFamilyCounts, upper2Index)) + " refs · " + str.tostring(math.abs(keyAbove2 - close) / atr, "#.##") + " ATR"
        if lower2Index >= 0
            below2Txt := str.tostring(keyBelow2, format.mintick) + " · " + str.tostring(array.get(clusterFamilyCounts, lower2Index)) + " refs · " + str.tostring(math.abs(close - keyBelow2) / atr, "#.##") + " ATR"
        string structureChangeTxt = structureChange == -1 ? "compressed" : structureChange == 1 ? "expanded" : structureChange == 2 ? "unchanged" : "building"
        string nearestTxt = nearestBoundary == 1 ? "Above 1 · " + str.tostring(math.abs(highDistance), "#.##") + " ATR away" : nearestBoundary == -1 ? "Below 1 · " + str.tostring(math.abs(lowDistance), "#.##") + " ATR away" : "Unavailable until a level exists"
        string structureTxt = na(structureWidthAtr) ? "Building complete Above 1 / Below 1 pair" : str.tostring(structureWidthAtr, "#.##") + " ATR wide · close at " + str.tostring(structurePosition, "#") + "% · " + structureChangeTxt
        string latestTxt = latestType == "—" ? "No completed break yet" : "Closed " + str.lower(latestType) + (na(latestLevel) ? "" : " · " + str.tostring(latestLevel, format.mintick)) + " · " + str.tostring(latestFamilyCount) + " refs · " + str.tostring(bar_index - latestBreakBar) + " bars ago"
        string volumeTxt = na(volume) ? "Volume unavailable from symbol" : na(volumeMultiple) ? "Volume average building" : str.tostring(volumeMultiple, "#.##") + "× 20-bar average"
        string priorRelationTxt = priorRangeRelation == 1 ? "above" : priorRangeRelation == -1 ? "below" : priorRangeRelation == 2 ? "inside" : "Unavailable"
        string overnightRelationTxt = overnightRangeRelation == 1 ? "above" : overnightRangeRelation == -1 ? "below" : overnightRangeRelation == 2 ? "inside" : "Unavailable"
        string longEvidenceTxt = sampleReady and baselineN > 0 ? "Favorable " + str.tostring(medianEvMfeL, "#.##") + " / " + str.tostring(medianBaseMfeL, "#.##") + " ATR" : evidenceReadyTxt
        string adverseEvidenceTxt = sampleReady and baselineN > 0 ? "Adverse " + str.tostring(medianEvMaeL, "#.##") + " / " + str.tostring(medianBaseMaeL, "#.##") + " ATR" : evidenceReadyTxt
        string returnEvidenceTxt = sampleReady ? str.tostring(100.0 * array.size(returnAges) / eventN, "#") + "% returned · " + str.tostring(100.0 * crossedCount / eventN, "#") + "% closed back through" : evidenceReadyTxt
        int row = 0

        table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Applied setup", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = sectionBg, tooltip = "The effective profile values used by detection. Custom uses the numeric Structure inputs.")
        table.cell(facts, 1, row, appliedTxt, text_color = color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = sectionBg)
        row += 1
        table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Current structure", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = sectionBg, tooltip = "A factual state machine: building pivots, monitoring boundaries, candidate activity, cancellation, or completed confirmation.")
        table.cell(facts, 1, row, stateTxt, text_color = stateColor, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = sectionBg)
        row += 1
        table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Above 1", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg, tooltip = "Nearest of the ranked displayed upper-source clusters. A pending candidate freezes this exact price.")
        table.cell(facts, 1, row, highTxt, text_color = na(shownAbove1) ? color.gray : color.aqua, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        row += 1
        table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Below 1", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg, tooltip = "Nearest of the ranked displayed lower-source clusters. A pending candidate freezes this exact price.")
        table.cell(facts, 1, row, lowTxt, text_color = na(shownBelow1) ? color.gray : color.orange, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        row += 1
        table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Above 2", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        table.cell(facts, 1, row, above2Txt, text_color = upper2Index < 0 ? color.gray : color.aqua, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        row += 1
        table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Below 2", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        table.cell(facts, 1, row, below2Txt, text_color = lower2Index < 0 ? color.gray : color.orange, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        row += 1
        table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Above reaction evidence", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = sectionBg, tooltip = highLevelEvidenceTooltip)
        table.cell(facts, 1, row, highLevelEvidenceText, text_color = highLevelStatus == 0 or highLevelStatus == -1 ? color.gray : color.aqua, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = sectionBg, tooltip = highLevelEvidenceTooltip)
        row += 1
        table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Below reaction evidence", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = sectionBg, tooltip = lowLevelEvidenceTooltip)
        table.cell(facts, 1, row, lowLevelEvidenceText, text_color = lowLevelStatus == 0 or lowLevelStatus == -1 ? color.gray : color.orange, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = sectionBg, tooltip = lowLevelEvidenceTooltip)
        row += 1
        table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Nearest boundary", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg, tooltip = "Whichever active boundary has the smaller absolute distance from the close, measured in current ATR.")
        table.cell(facts, 1, row, nearestTxt, text_color = nearestBoundary == 1 ? color.aqua : nearestBoundary == -1 ? color.orange : color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        row += 1
        table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Level span / location", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg, tooltip = "Span is Above 1 minus Below 1 in ATR. Location is the close's percentage position inside that pair. Compression compares snapshots only when a selected cluster identity changes.")
        table.cell(facts, 1, row, structureTxt, text_color = na(structureWidthAtr) ? color.gray : color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        row += 1
        table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Latest confirmed", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        table.cell(facts, 1, row, latestTxt, text_color = latestType == "—" ? color.gray : color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        row += 1
        table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Historical evidence", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = sectionBg, tooltip = "Completed breaks matching the latest event cohort. Statistics remain hidden until the configured minimum sample count is reached.")
        table.cell(facts, 1, row, evidenceReadyTxt, text_color = sampleReady ? color.white : color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = sectionBg)
        row += 1

        if dashboardDetail == "Standard"
            table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Initial / confirm / delay", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg, tooltip = "Initial clearance is frozen on the first qualifying close. Confirmation clearance is measured later on the confirmation bar. Both use ATR.")
            table.cell(facts, 1, row, na(latestInitialClearance) ? "No completed break yet" : str.tostring(latestInitialClearance, "#.##") + " / " + str.tostring(latestConfirmClearance, "#.##") + " ATR · " + str.tostring(latestCandidateDelay) + " bars", text_color = na(latestInitialClearance) ? color.gray : color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            row += 1
            table.cell(facts, 0, row, "ATR / volume", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg, tooltip = "ATR is average true range over the selected lookback. Volume multiple compares the current bar with its 20-bar average when the symbol supplies volume.")
            table.cell(facts, 1, row, str.tostring(atr, format.mintick) + " · " + volumeTxt, text_color = color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            row += 1
            if showSessionContext
                table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Session elapsed / range", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg, tooltip = "Completed-bar time from the configured exchange-time session start, plus current session range and close location.")
                table.cell(facts, 1, row, na(sessionElapsedMinutes) ? "Outside selected session" : str.tostring(sessionElapsedMinutes, "#") + " min · " + str.tostring(sessionRangeAtr, "#.##") + " ATR · " + str.tostring(sessionRangePosition, "#") + "%", text_color = na(sessionElapsedMinutes) ? color.gray : color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
                row += 1
                table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Opening / prior range", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
                table.cell(facts, 1, row, na(openingRangeHigh) ? "Opening range unavailable" : str.tostring(openingRangeHigh, format.mintick) + " / " + str.tostring(openingRangeLow, format.mintick) + " · prior " + priorRelationTxt, text_color = na(openingRangeHigh) ? color.gray : color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
                row += 1
                table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Overnight range", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg, tooltip = "Calculated only from overnight bars present in the loaded chart. It remains unavailable when those bars are absent.")
                table.cell(facts, 1, row, na(referenceOvernightHigh) ? "Overnight unavailable: no overnight bars loaded" : str.tostring(referenceOvernightHigh, format.mintick) + " / " + str.tostring(referenceOvernightLow, format.mintick) + " · close " + overnightRelationTxt, text_color = na(referenceOvernightHigh) ? color.gray : color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
                row += 1
            table.cell(facts, 0, row, str.tostring(evidenceLong) + "-bar favorable", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg, tooltip = "Median maximum favorable excursion for matching breaks / ordinary non-break starting bars, in frozen event ATR.")
            table.cell(facts, 1, row, longEvidenceTxt, text_color = sampleReady and baselineN > 0 ? color.white : color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            row += 1
            table.cell(facts, 0, row, str.tostring(evidenceLong) + "-bar adverse", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg, tooltip = "Median maximum adverse excursion for matching breaks / ordinary non-break starting bars, in frozen event ATR.")
            table.cell(facts, 1, row, adverseEvidenceTxt, text_color = sampleReady and baselineN > 0 ? color.white : color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            row += 1
            table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Return / crossed back", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg, tooltip = "Historical proportion returning under the configured broken-level rule, and proportion later closing through the broken level.")
            table.cell(facts, 1, row, returnEvidenceTxt, text_color = sampleReady ? color.white : color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)

        if dashboardDetail == "Research"
            // Research appends every v8.2 facts-table field below the guided header.
            table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Initial / confirm clearance", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg, tooltip = "Frozen initial-cross clearance / confirmation-bar clearance, both in ATR.")
            table.cell(facts, 1, row, na(latestInitialClearance) ? "No completed break yet" : str.tostring(latestInitialClearance, "#.##") + " / " + str.tostring(latestConfirmClearance, "#.##") + " ATR", text_color = na(latestInitialClearance) ? color.gray : color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            row += 1
            table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Confirmation delay", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            table.cell(facts, 1, row, na(latestBreakBar) ? "No completed break yet" : str.tostring(latestCandidateDelay) + " bars · " + str.tostring(bar_index - latestBreakBar) + " since", text_color = na(latestBreakBar) ? color.gray : color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            row += 1
            table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Candidate / confirm session", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            table.cell(facts, 1, row, latestType == "—" ? "No completed break yet" : (latestCandidateSession ? "in" : "out") + " / " + (latestConfirmationSession ? "in" : "out"), text_color = latestType == "—" ? color.gray : color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            row += 1
            table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Pending candidate", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            table.cell(facts, 1, row, pendingTxt, text_color = not na(pendingUpBar) or not na(pendingDownBar) ? color.yellow : color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            row += 1
            table.cell(facts, 0, row, "ATR / percentile", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg, tooltip = "Average true range / percentile rank of ATR over 100 bars.")
            table.cell(facts, 1, row, str.tostring(atr, format.mintick) + " · " + str.tostring(atrPct, "#") + "th", text_color = color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            row += 1
            table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Volume multiple", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            table.cell(facts, 1, row, volumeTxt, text_color = na(volumeMultiple) ? color.gray : color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            row += 1
            table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Selected session", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            table.cell(facts, 1, row, insideSession ? "inside" : "outside", text_color = color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            row += 1
            table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Current session O / H / L", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            table.cell(facts, 1, row, na(sessionOpen) ? "Outside selected session" : str.tostring(sessionOpen, format.mintick) + " / " + str.tostring(sessionHigh, format.mintick) + " / " + str.tostring(sessionLow, format.mintick), text_color = na(sessionOpen) ? color.gray : color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            row += 1
            table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Prior session O / H / L", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            table.cell(facts, 1, row, na(priorSessionOpen) ? "Prior session unavailable" : str.tostring(priorSessionOpen, format.mintick) + " / " + str.tostring(priorSessionHigh, format.mintick) + " / " + str.tostring(priorSessionLow, format.mintick), text_color = na(priorSessionOpen) ? color.gray : color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            row += 1
            table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Snapshot change", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            table.cell(facts, 1, row, structureChangeTxt, text_color = color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            row += 1
            table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Boundary ages", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            table.cell(facts, 1, row, "High " + (na(activeHighAge) ? "unavailable" : str.tostring(activeHighAge)) + " · Low " + (na(activeLowAge) ? "unavailable" : str.tostring(activeLowAge)), text_color = color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            row += 1
            table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Session elapsed / range", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            table.cell(facts, 1, row, na(sessionElapsedMinutes) ? "Outside selected session" : str.tostring(sessionElapsedMinutes, "#") + " min · " + str.tostring(sessionRangeAtr, "#.##") + " ATR", text_color = na(sessionElapsedMinutes) ? color.gray : color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            row += 1
            table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Session location", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            table.cell(facts, 1, row, na(sessionRangePosition) ? "Outside selected session" : str.tostring(sessionRangePosition, "#") + "% · H " + str.tostring(currentSessionHighDistance, "#.##") + " / L " + str.tostring(currentSessionLowDistance, "#.##") + " ATR", text_color = na(sessionRangePosition) ? color.gray : color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            row += 1
            table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Prior range relation", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            table.cell(facts, 1, row, priorRelationTxt + (priorRangeRelation == 0 ? "" : " · H " + str.tostring(priorHighDistance, "#.##") + " / L " + str.tostring(priorLowDistance, "#.##") + " ATR"), text_color = priorRangeRelation == 0 ? color.gray : color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            row += 1
            table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Opening range H / L", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            table.cell(facts, 1, row, na(openingRangeHigh) ? "Opening range unavailable" : str.tostring(openingRangeHigh, format.mintick) + " / " + str.tostring(openingRangeLow, format.mintick) + (openingRangeComplete ? " · complete" : " · forming"), text_color = na(openingRangeHigh) ? color.gray : color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            row += 1
            table.cell(facts, 0, row, "Overnight H / L / relation", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
            table.cell(facts, 1, row, na(referenceOvernightHigh) ? "Overnight unavailable: no overnight bars loaded" : str.tostring(referenceOvernightHigh, format.mintick) + " / " + str.tostring(referenceOvernightLow, format.mintick) + " · " + overnightRelationTxt, text_color = na(referenceOvernightHigh) ? color.gray : color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)

// Full cohort table is intentionally reserved for Research detail.
var table evidenceTable = table.new(tablePositionOf(evidenceTablePosition), 2, 9, border_width = 1, border_color = color.new(color.gray, 70))
if barstate.islast
    table.clear(evidenceTable, 0, 0, 1, 8)
    if showEvidenceTable and enableEvidence and dashboardDetail == "Research"
        color bg = color.new(color.black, 20)
        string contextTxt = latestEvidenceDirection == 0 ? "No completed break yet" : (latestEvidenceDirection == 1 ? "up · " : "down · ") + evidenceCohort + " · base ≤D/S/ATR"
        string shortTxt = sampleReady and baselineN > 0 ? str.tostring(medianEvMfeS, "#.##") + " / " + str.tostring(medianBaseMfeS, "#.##") + " ATR" : evidenceReadyTxt
        string mediumTxt = sampleReady and baselineN > 0 ? str.tostring(medianEvMfeM, "#.##") + " / " + str.tostring(medianBaseMfeM, "#.##") + " ATR" : evidenceReadyTxt
        string longTxt = sampleReady and baselineN > 0 ? str.tostring(medianEvMfeL, "#.##") + " / " + str.tostring(medianBaseMfeL, "#.##") + " ATR" : evidenceReadyTxt
        string adverseTxt = sampleReady and baselineN > 0 ? str.tostring(medianEvMaeL, "#.##") + " / " + str.tostring(medianBaseMaeL, "#.##") + " ATR" : evidenceReadyTxt
        string firstTxt = eventN > 0 ? "F " + str.tostring(100.0 * firstFav / eventN, "#") + "% · A " + str.tostring(100.0 * firstAdv / eventN, "#") + "% · X " + str.tostring(100.0 * firstAmbiguous / eventN, "#") + "% · N " + str.tostring(100.0 * firstNeither / eventN, "#") + "%" : "No completed break yet"
        string returnTxt = eventN > 0 ? str.tostring(100.0 * array.size(returnAges) / eventN, "#") + "% · median age " + (na(medianReturnAge) ? "unavailable" : str.tostring(medianReturnAge, "#")) : "No completed break yet"
        table.cell(evidenceTable, 0, 0, "Evidence context", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg, tooltip = "Break cohort follows the selected context. Ordinary-bar baseline matching is limited to direction, session, and ATR where available.")
        table.cell(evidenceTable, 1, 0, contextTxt, text_color = color.white, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        table.cell(evidenceTable, 0, 1, "Break / ordinary-bar n", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        table.cell(evidenceTable, 1, 1, evidenceReadyTxt, text_color = sampleReady ? color.white : color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        table.cell(evidenceTable, 0, 2, str.tostring(evidenceShort) + "b favorable · break/base", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg, tooltip = "Median maximum favorable excursion in frozen event ATR. Break cohort / ordinary non-break starting bars.")
        table.cell(evidenceTable, 1, 2, shortTxt, text_color = sampleReady ? color.white : color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        table.cell(evidenceTable, 0, 3, str.tostring(evidenceMedium) + "b favorable · break/base", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        table.cell(evidenceTable, 1, 3, mediumTxt, text_color = sampleReady ? color.white : color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        table.cell(evidenceTable, 0, 4, str.tostring(evidenceLong) + "b favorable · break/base", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        table.cell(evidenceTable, 1, 4, longTxt, text_color = sampleReady ? color.white : color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        table.cell(evidenceTable, 0, 5, str.tostring(evidenceLong) + "b adverse · break/base", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg, tooltip = "Median maximum adverse excursion in frozen event ATR. Break cohort / ordinary non-break starting bars.")
        table.cell(evidenceTable, 1, 5, adverseTxt, text_color = sampleReady ? color.white : color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        table.cell(evidenceTable, 0, 6, "First ±" + str.tostring(evidenceThreshold, "#.##") + " ATR", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg, tooltip = "F favorable first; A adverse first; X both within one bar so order is unknown; N neither threshold reached.")
        table.cell(evidenceTable, 1, 6, sampleReady ? firstTxt : evidenceReadyTxt, text_color = sampleReady ? color.white : color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        table.cell(evidenceTable, 0, 7, "Returned / median bars", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg, tooltip = "Share with an eligible broken-level return and the median first-return age.")
        table.cell(evidenceTable, 1, 7, sampleReady ? returnTxt : evidenceReadyTxt, text_color = sampleReady ? color.white : color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        table.cell(evidenceTable, 0, 8, "Closed back through", text_color = color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)
        table.cell(evidenceTable, 1, 8, sampleReady ? str.tostring(100.0 * crossedCount / eventN, "#") + "%" : evidenceReadyTxt, text_color = sampleReady ? color.white : color.gray, text_size = size.tiny, bgcolor = bg)

// ───────────────────────────── Auditable export ────────────────────────────
// The four former relationship/active-boundary slots now export the four
// displayed key-cluster prices without increasing plot-count use.
plot(keyAbove2, "Key level above 2", display = display.data_window + display.price_scale)
plot(anyBreak ? (breakUp and breakDown ? 0 : breakUp ? 1 : -1) : na, "Break direction · 1 up, -1 down, 0 dual", display = display.data_window)
plot(anyBreak ? (anyVisibleBreak ? 1 : 0) : na, "Break displayed by session filter", display = display.data_window)
plot(breakUp ? upBreakLevel : breakDown ? downBreakLevel : na, "Break level", display = display.data_window)
plot(anyBreak ? breakLevelBar : na, "Break source bar index", display = display.data_window)
plot(anyBreak and not na(breakLevelBar) ? bar_index - breakLevelBar : na, "Break source age at confirmation · bars", display = display.data_window)
plot(anyBreak ? candidateBar : na, "Initial-cross bar index", display = display.data_window)
plot(anyBreak ? confirmationDelay : na, "Initial-cross to confirmation · bars", display = display.data_window)
plot(anyBreak ? candidateClearance : na, "Initial-cross clearance · ATR", display = display.data_window)
plot(anyBreak ? confirmationClearance : na, "Confirmation clearance · ATR", display = display.data_window)
plot(anyBreak ? candidateRangeAtr : na, "Initial-cross candle range · ATR", display = display.data_window)
plot(anyBreak ? candidateBodyRatio : na, "Initial-cross candle body ÷ range", display = display.data_window)
plot(anyBreak ? candidateVolumeMultiple : na, "Initial-cross volume multiple", display = display.data_window)
plot(anyBreak ? candidateAtr : na, "ATR at initial cross", display = display.data_window)
plot(anyBreak ? (candidateInsideSession ? 2 : 0) + (insideSession ? 1 : 0) : na, "Session state · bit 2 initial, bit 1 confirmation", display = display.data_window)
plot(returnFromAbove ? 1 : returnFromBelow ? -1 : na, "Broken-level return direction", display = display.data_window)
plot(returnFromAbove or returnFromBelow ? returnedLevel : na, "Broken-level returned price", display = display.data_window)
plot(returnsThisBar > 0 ? returnsThisBar : na, "Broken-level returns on bar", display = display.data_window)
plot(array.size(returnLevels), "Broken levels currently tracked", display = display.data_window)
plot(expiredBrokenLevels, "Broken levels expired · cumulative", display = display.data_window)
plot(capacityDroppedLevels, "Broken levels capacity-dropped · cumulative", display = display.data_window)
plot(atr, "ATR", display = display.data_window)
plot(atrPct, "ATR percentile · 100 bars", display = display.data_window)
plot(volumeMultiple, "Volume multiple", display = display.data_window)
plot(keyAbove1, "Key level above 1", display = display.data_window + display.price_scale)
plot(keyBelow1, "Key level below 1", display = display.data_window + display.price_scale)
plot(highDistance, "Distance to key level above 1 · ATR", display = display.data_window)
plot(lowDistance, "Distance to key level below 1 · ATR", display = display.data_window)
plot(highApproaches, "Approaches · key level above 1", display = display.data_window)
plot(lowApproaches, "Approaches · key level below 1", display = display.data_window)
plot(structureWidthAtr, "Active structure span · ATR", display = display.data_window)
plot(structurePosition, "Close location in active structure · percent", display = display.data_window)
plot(structureChange, "Structure snapshot change · -1 compressed, 1 expanded, 2 unchanged", display = display.data_window)
plot(sessionElapsedMinutes, "Selected-session elapsed minutes", display = display.data_window)
plot(sessionRangeAtr, "Selected-session range · ATR", display = display.data_window)
plot(sessionRangePosition, "Close location in selected-session range · percent", display = display.data_window)
plot(priorRangeRelation, "Prior-session relation · 1 above, -1 below, 2 inside", display = display.data_window)
plot(openingRangeHigh, "Opening-range high", display = display.data_window)
plot(openingRangeLow, "Opening-range low", display = display.data_window)
plot(referenceOvernightHigh, "Overnight high", display = display.data_window)
plot(referenceOvernightLow, "Overnight low", display = display.data_window)

plot(keyBelow2, "Key level below 2", display = display.data_window + display.price_scale)
plot(evidenceResolved ? resolvedMfeShort : na, "Evidence short · favorable excursion ATR", display = display.data_window)
plot(evidenceResolved ? resolvedMaeShort : na, "Evidence short · adverse excursion ATR", display = display.data_window)
plot(evidenceResolved ? resolvedFinalShort : na, "Evidence short · final displacement ATR", display = display.data_window)
plot(evidenceResolved ? resolvedFirstShort : na, "Evidence short · first threshold outcome", display = display.data_window)
plot(evidenceResolved ? resolvedMfeMedium : na, "Evidence medium · favorable excursion ATR", display = display.data_window)
plot(evidenceResolved ? resolvedMaeMedium : na, "Evidence medium · adverse excursion ATR", display = display.data_window)
plot(evidenceResolved ? resolvedFinalMedium : na, "Evidence medium · final displacement ATR", display = display.data_window)
plot(evidenceResolved ? resolvedFirstMedium : na, "Evidence medium · first threshold outcome", display = display.data_window)
plot(evidenceResolved ? resolvedMfeLong : na, "Evidence long · favorable excursion ATR", display = display.data_window)
plot(evidenceResolved ? resolvedMaeLong : na, "Evidence long · adverse excursion ATR", display = display.data_window)
plot(evidenceResolved ? resolvedFinalLong : na, "Evidence long · final displacement ATR", display = display.data_window)
plot(evidenceResolved ? resolvedFirstLong : na, "Evidence long · first threshold outcome", display = display.data_window)
plot(evidenceResolved ? resolvedReturnAge : na, "Evidence · first broken-level return age", display = display.data_window)
plot(evidenceResolved ? (resolvedCrossedBack ? 1 : 0) : na, "Evidence · closed back through broken level", display = display.data_window)

int advanceEventCount = (evtApproachHigh ? 1 : 0) + (evtApproachLow ? 1 : 0) + (evtCandidateUpStarted ? 1 : 0) + (evtCandidateDownStarted ? 1 : 0) + (evtCandidateUpCanceled ? 1 : 0) + (evtCandidateDownCanceled ? 1 : 0) + (evtUpOneRemaining ? 1 : 0) + (evtDownOneRemaining ? 1 : 0) + (evtBrokenLevelArmedUp ? 1 : 0) + (evtBrokenLevelArmedDown ? 1 : 0) + (evtBrokenLevelApproachUp ? 1 : 0) + (evtBrokenLevelApproachDown ? 1 : 0)
int advanceEventCode = evtCandidateUpStarted ? 2 : evtCandidateDownStarted ? -2 : evtCandidateUpCanceled ? 3 : evtCandidateDownCanceled ? -3 : evtUpOneRemaining ? 4 : evtDownOneRemaining ? -4 : evtBrokenLevelArmedUp ? 5 : evtBrokenLevelArmedDown ? -5 : evtBrokenLevelApproachUp ? 6 : evtBrokenLevelApproachDown ? -6 : evtApproachHigh ? 1 : evtApproachLow ? -1 : 0
plot(advanceEventCount > 0 ? advanceEventCode : na, "Advance event code", display = display.data_window)
plot(advanceEventCount > 0 ? advanceEventCount : na, "Advance event types on bar", display = display.data_window)

// ───────────────────────────── Factual alerts ──────────────────────────────
alertcondition(visibleBreakUp, "Key level closed above", "A confirmed close remained above the monitored key level on {{ticker}} @ {{close}}")
alertcondition(visibleBreakDown, "Key level closed below", "A confirmed close remained below the monitored key level on {{ticker}} @ {{close}}")
alertcondition(visibleReturnFromAbove, "Return to upward-broken level", "Price returned to a previously upward-broken key level and closed at or above it on {{ticker}} @ {{close}}")
alertcondition(visibleReturnFromBelow, "Return to downward-broken level", "Price returned to a previously downward-broken key level and closed at or below it on {{ticker}} @ {{close}}")

// Dynamic messages preserve the exact transition type without spending one
// plot count per alertcondition. In TradingView choose "Any alert() function
// call" for this indicator. All calls occur on completed bars only.
bool candidateNoticesEnabled = advanceNoticeDetail == "Candidates" or advanceNoticeDetail == "All transitions"
bool allTransitionNoticesEnabled = advanceNoticeDetail == "All transitions"
if enableAdvanceAlerts and eventVisibleNow and barstate.isconfirmed and advanceNoticeDetail != "Confirmed only"
    if allTransitionNoticesEnabled and evtApproachHigh
        alert("First approach to key level above " + str.tostring(approachedActiveHighLevel, format.mintick), alert.freq_all)
    if allTransitionNoticesEnabled and evtApproachLow
        alert("First approach to key level below " + str.tostring(approachedActiveLowLevel, format.mintick), alert.freq_all)
    if candidateNoticesEnabled and evtCandidateUpStarted
        alert("Upward break candidate started above " + str.tostring(pendingUpLevel, format.mintick), alert.freq_all)
    if candidateNoticesEnabled and evtCandidateDownStarted
        alert("Downward break candidate started below " + str.tostring(pendingDownLevel, format.mintick), alert.freq_all)
    if candidateNoticesEnabled and evtCandidateUpCanceled
        alert("Upward break candidate canceled at " + str.tostring(pendingUpLevel, format.mintick), alert.freq_all)
    if candidateNoticesEnabled and evtCandidateDownCanceled
        alert("Downward break candidate canceled at " + str.tostring(pendingDownLevel, format.mintick), alert.freq_all)
    if candidateNoticesEnabled and evtUpOneRemaining
        alert("Upward break candidate has one configured confirmation bar remaining", alert.freq_all)
    if candidateNoticesEnabled and evtDownOneRemaining
        alert("Downward break candidate has one configured confirmation bar remaining", alert.freq_all)
    if allTransitionNoticesEnabled and evtBrokenLevelArmedUp
        alert("Upward-broken level moved outside its return band: " + str.tostring(armedBrokenLevelUp, format.mintick), alert.freq_all)
    if allTransitionNoticesEnabled and evtBrokenLevelArmedDown
        alert("Downward-broken level moved outside its return band: " + str.tostring(armedBrokenLevelDown, format.mintick), alert.freq_all)
    if allTransitionNoticesEnabled and evtBrokenLevelApproachUp
        alert("Price re-entered the band of an upward-broken level: " + str.tostring(approachedBrokenLevelUp, format.mintick), alert.freq_all)
    if allTransitionNoticesEnabled and evtBrokenLevelApproachDown
        alert("Price re-entered the band of a downward-broken level: " + str.tostring(approachedBrokenLevelDown, format.mintick), alert.freq_all)
